verse	1	35	11	pinnum theavan avanai noakki: naan sarvavallamaiyu'l'la theavan, nee palugip peruguvaayaaga; oru jaathiyum pa'rpala jaathiga'lin koottangga'lum unnilirunthu u'ndaagum; raajaakka'lum un santhathiyil pi'rappaarga'l. 
