verse	3	15	1	pinnum karththar moaseayaiyum aaroanaiyum noakki: 
verse	3	15	2	neengga'l israveal puththiraroadea sollavea'ndiyathu ennaven'raal: oruvanukkup piramiyam u'ndaanaal, avan than piramiyaththinaalea theettaanavan. 
verse	3	15	3	avanudaiya maamsaththilu'l'la piramiyam oo'rikko'ndirunthaalum, avan piramiyam adaipattirunthaalum, athinaal avanukkuth theettu'ndaagum. 
verse	3	15	4	piramiyamu'l'lavan padukki'ra enthap padukkaiyum theettaagum; avan ethinmeal udkaarugi'raanoa athuvum theettaagum. 
