verse	3	15	19	soothagasthiree than sareeraththilu'l'la uthira oo'ralinimiththam eazhunaa'l than vilakkaththil irukkakkadava'l; ava'laith thodugi'ravan evanum saayanggaalamattum theettuppattiruppaanaaga. 
