verse	3	16	3	aaroan parisuththa sthalaththukku'l piraveasikkavea'ndiya vithamaavathu: avan oru kaa'laiyaip paavanivaara'nabaliyaagavum, oru aattukkadaavaich sarvaangga thaganabaliyaagavum seluththip piraveasikkavea'ndum. 
verse	3	16	4	avan parisuththamaana sa'nalnool sattaiyaith thariththu, than araikkuch sa'nalnool jalladaththaip poattu, sa'nalnool idaikkachchaiyaik katti, sa'nalnool paagaiyaith thariththukko'ndirukkavea'ndum; avaiga'l parisuththa vasthirangga'l; avan jalaththilea snaanampa'n'ni, avaiga'laith thariththukko'ndu, 
