verse	3	17	6	anggea aasaariyan iraththaththai aasarippuk koodaaravaasalilirukki'ra karththarudaiya balipeedaththinmeal the'liththu, kozhuppaik karththarukkuch sugantha vaasanaiyaagath thaganikkakkadavan. 
verse	3	17	7	thaangga'l soaramaarkkamaayp pinpat'rugi'ra peayga'lukkuth thangga'l baliga'lai inich seluththaathiruppaarga'laaga; ithu avarga'l thalaimu'raithoa'rum avarga'lukku niththiya katta'laiyaayirukkakkadavathu. 
verse	3	17	8	mealum nee avarga'lai noakki: israveal kudumbaththaarilum ungga'l naduvea thanggugi'ra anniyarga'lilum evanaagilum sarvaangga thaganabali muthalaanavaiga'laiyittu, 
verse	3	17	9	athai aasarippuk koodaaravaasalilea karththarukkuch seluththumpadi ko'nduvaraavittaal, avan than janaththil iraamal a'ruppu'ndupoavaan en'ru sol. 
verse	3	17	10	israveal kudumbaththaarilum ungga'lukku'l thanggum anniyarga'lilum evanaagilum iraththam ennappattathaip pusiththaal, iraththaththaip pusiththa avanukku viroathamaaga naan en mugaththaith thiruppi, avan than janaththil iraathapadikku avanai a'ruppu'ndupoagap pa'n'nuvean. 
verse	3	17	11	maamsaththin uyir iraththaththil irukki'rathu; naan athai ungga'lukkup balipeedaththinmeal ungga'l aaththumaakka'lukkaagap paavanivirththi seyyumpadikkuk katta'laiyittean; aaththumaavi'rkaagap paavanivirththi seygi'rathu iraththamea. 
