verse	4	1	17	appadiyea moaseayum aaroanum pearpearaagak ku'rikkappatta intha manitharaik koottikko'ndu, 
verse	4	1	18	ira'ndaam maatham muthal theathiyil sabaiyaar ellaaraiyum koodivarachseythaarga'l. appozhuthu avarga'l thangga'l thangga'l kudumbaththinpadikkum, pithaakka'ludaiya vamsaththinpadikkum, naamath thogaiyinpadikkum, irubathu vayathu'l'lavarga'l muthal thalaithalaiyaagath thangga'l vamsa u'rpaththiyaith theriviththaarga'l. 
verse	4	1	19	ippadik karththar katta'laiyittapadiyea, moasea avarga'laich seenaay vanaantharaththil e'n'nippaarththaan. 
