verse	4	1	39	thaa'n koaththiraththil e'n'nappattavarga'l, a'rubaththeeraayiraththu ezhunoo'rupear. 
verse	4	1	40	aasear puththirarudaiya pithaakka'lin veettu vamsaththaaril irubathu vayathu'l'lavarga'l muthal yuththaththi'rkup pu'rappadaththakka purusharga'l ellaarum e'n'nappattapoathu, 
verse	4	1	41	aasear koaththiraththil e'n'nappattavarga'l, naa'rpaththoaraayiraththu ainnoo'rupear. 
verse	4	1	42	napthali puththirarudaiya pithaakka'lin veettu vamsaththaaril irubathu vayathu'l'lavarga'l muthal yuththaththi'rkup pu'rappadaththakka purusharga'l ellaarum e'n'nappattapoathu, 
verse	4	1	43	napthali koaththiraththil e'n'nappattavarga'l, aimbaththu moovaayiraththu naanoo'rupear. 
verse	4	1	44	e'n'nappattavarga'l ivarga'lea; moaseayum aaroanum isravealudaiya pithaakka'lin vamsaththil ovvoru vamsaththukku ovvoru pirabuvaagiya pannira'ndupearum e'n'ninaarga'l. 
verse	4	1	45	israveal puththirarudaiya pithaakka'lin vamsaththil irubathu vayathu'l'lavarga'lmuthal, isravealil yuththaththi'rkup pu'rappadaththakkavarga'laagiya e'n'nappatta pearga'l ellaarum, 
verse	4	1	46	aa'ruladchaththu moovaayiraththu ainnoot'ru aimbathu pearaayirunthaarga'l. 
verse	4	1	47	leaviyar thangga'l pithaakka'ludaiya koaththiraththinpadiyea, mat'ravarga'ludanea e'n'nappadavillai. 
verse	4	1	48	karththar moaseayai noakki: 
verse	4	1	49	nee leavi koaththiraththaaraimaaththiram e'n'naamalum, israveal puththirarukku'l'lea avarga'l thogaiyai eat'raamalum, 
verse	4	1	50	leaviyaraich saadchiyin vaasasthalaththi'rkum, athinudaiya sagala pa'nimuttuga'lukkum, athilu'l'la samastha poru'lga'lukkum visaarippukkaararaaga ea'rpaduththu; avarga'l vaasasthalaththaiyum athin sagala pa'nimuttuga'laiyum sumappaarga'laaga; athinidaththil oozhiyam seythu, vaasasthalaththaich sut'rilum paa'layami'ranggakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	1	51	vaasasthalam pu'rappadumpoathu, leaviyar athai i'rakkivaiththu, athu sthaabanam pa'n'nappadumpoathu, leaviyar athai eduththu ni'ruththakkadavarga'l; anniyan atha'rkuch sameebaththil vanthaal kolaiseyyappadakkadavan. 
verse	4	1	52	israveal puththirar thangga'l thangga'l paa'layaththoadum, thangga'l thangga'l seanaiyin kodiyoadum koodaaram poadakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	1	53	israveal puththiraraagiya sabaiyinmeal kadungkoabam varaathapadikku leaviyar saadchiyin vaasasthalaththaich sut'rilum paa'layami'ranggi, leaviyar saadchiyin vaasasthalaththaik kaavalkaappaarga'laaga en'raar. 
verse	4	1	54	karththar moaseakkuk katta'laiyittapadi ellaavat'raiyum israveal puththirar seythaarga'l. 
verse	4	2	1	karththar moaseayaiyum aaroanaiyum noakki: 
verse	4	2	2	israveal puththirar avaravar thangga'l thangga'l pithaakka'ludaiya vamsaththin viruthaagiya thangga'l thangga'l kodiya'ndaiyilea thangga'l koodaarangga'laip poattu, aasarippuk koodaaraththi'rku ethiraagach sut'rilum paa'layami'ranggakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	2	3	yoothaavin paa'layaththuk kodiyaiyudaiya seanaiga'l sooriyan uthikkum keezhppu'raththilea paa'layami'ranggavea'ndum; amminathaabin kumaaranaagiya nagasoan yoothaa santhathikkuch seanaabathiyaayirukkakkadavan. 
verse	4	2	4	e'n'nappatta avanudaiya seanai ezhubaththu naalaayiraththu a'runoo'rupear. 
verse	4	2	5	avan arugea isakkaar koaththiraththaar paa'layami'ranggavea'ndum; soovaarin kumaaran nethaneyeal isakkaar santhathikkuch seanaabathiyaayirukkakkadavan. 
verse	4	2	6	e'n'nappatta avanudaiya seanai aimbaththu naalaayiraththu naanoo'rupear. 
verse	4	2	7	avan arugea sebuloan koaththiraththaar paa'layami'ranggavea'ndum; ealoanin kumaaranaagiya eliyaab sebuloan santhathikkuch seanaabathiyaayirukkakkadavan. 
verse	4	2	8	avanudaiya seanaiyil e'n'nappattavarga'l aimbaththeazhaayiraththu naanoo'rupear. 
verse	4	2	9	e'n'nappatta yoothaavin paa'layaththaar ellaarum thangga'l seanaiga'linpadiyea iladchaththu e'nbaththu aa'raayiraththu naanoo'rupear; ivarga'l pirayaa'naththilea mutha'rpaa'layamaayp poagakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	2	10	roobanudaiya paa'layaththuk kodiyaiyudaiya seanaiga'l thenpu'raththil paa'layami'ranggavea'ndum; seatheayoorin kumaaranaagiya elisoor rooban santhathiyaarukkuch seanaabathiyaayirukkakkadavan. 
verse	4	2	11	avanudaiya seanaiyil e'n'nappattavarga'l naa'rpaththaa'raayiraththu ainnoo'rupear. 
verse	4	2	12	avan arugea simiyoan koaththiraththaar paa'layami'ranggavea'ndum; soorishathaayin kumaaranaagiya seloomiyeal simiyoan santhathiyaarukkuch seanaabathiyaayirukkakkadavan. 
verse	4	2	13	avanudaiya seanaiyil e'n'nappattavarga'l aimbaththonbathinaayiraththu munnoo'rupear. 
verse	4	2	14	avan arugea kaath koaththiraththaar paa'layami'ranggavea'ndum; theaguvealin kumaaranaagiya eliyaasaap kaath santhathiyaarukkuch seanaabathiyaayirukkakkadavan. 
verse	4	2	15	avanudaiya seanaiyil e'n'nappattavarga'l naa'rpaththaiyaayiraththu a'runoot'ru aimbathupear. 
verse	4	2	16	e'n'nappatta roobanin paa'layaththaar ellaarum thangga'l seanaiga'linpadiyea iladchaththu aimbaththu oaraayiraththu naanoot'ru aimbathupear; ivarga'l pirayaa'naththil ira'ndaam paa'layamaayp poagakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	2	17	pinbu aasarippuk koodaaram leaviyarin seanaiyoadea paa'layangga'lin naduvea pirayaa'nappattup poagavea'ndum; eppadip paa'layami'ranggugi'raarga'loa, appadiyea avaravar thangga'l varisaiyilea thangga'l kodiga'loadea pirayaa'namaayp poagakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	2	18	eppiraayeemudaiya paa'layaththuk kodiyaiyudaiya seanaiga'l mealpu'raththil i'ranggavea'ndum; ammiyoothin kumaaranaagiya elishaamaa eppiraayeemin santhathikkuch seanaabathiyaayirukkakkadavan. 
verse	4	2	19	avanudaiya seanaiyil e'n'nappattavarga'l naa'rpathinaayiraththu ainnoo'rupear. 
