verse	4	2	28	avanudaiya seanaiyil e'n'nappattavarga'l naa'rpaththoaraayiraththu ainnoo'rupear. 
verse	4	2	29	avan arugea napthali koaththiraththaar paa'layami'ranggavea'ndum; eanaanin kumaaranaagiya ageeraa napthali santhathiyaarukkuch seanaabathiyaayirukkakkadavan. 
verse	4	2	30	avanudaiya seanaiyil e'n'nappattavarga'l aimbaththu moovaayiraththu naanoo'rupear. 
verse	4	2	31	e'n'nappatta thaa'nin paa'layaththaar ellaarum iladchaththu aimbaththeazhaayiraththu a'runoo'rupear; ivarga'l thangga'l kodiga'loadea pinpaa'layamaayp poagakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	2	32	ivarga'lea thangga'l thangga'l pithaakka'lin vamsaththinpadi israveal puththiraril e'n'nappattavarga'l. paa'layangga'lilea thangga'l thangga'l seanaiga'linpadiyea e'n'nappattavarga'l ellaarum aa'ruladchaththu moovaayiraththu ainnoot'ru aimbathu pearaayirunthaarga'l. 
verse	4	2	33	leaviyaroa, karththar moaseakkuk katta'laiyittapadi, israveal puththirarukku'l'lea e'n'nappadavillai. 
verse	4	2	34	karththar moaseakkuk katta'laiyittapadiyellaam israveal puththirar seythu, thangga'l thangga'l kodiga'linkeezh paa'layami'ranggi, thangga'l thangga'l pithaakka'ludaiya vamsangga'linpadiyea pirayaa'nappattuppoanaarga'l. 
verse	4	3	1	seenaay malaiyil karththar moaseayoadea peasina naa'lilea, aaroan moasea enbavarga'ludaiya vamsavaralaa'raavathu: 
verse	4	3	2	aaroanudaiya kumaarar, muthal pi'ranthavanaagiya naathaab, abiyoo, eleyaasaar, iththaamaar enbavarga'lea. 
verse	4	3	3	aasaariya oozhiyamseygi'ratha'rku avanaal pirathishdai seyyappattu abisheagampet'ra aasaariyaraana aaroanudaiya kumaararin naamangga'l ivaiga'lea. 
verse	4	3	4	naathaabum abiyoovum seenaay vanaantharaththil anniya akkiniyaik karththarudaiya sannithiyil ko'nduvanthapoathu, karththarudaiya sannithiyil mariththuppoanaarga'l; avarga'lukkup pi'l'laiga'l illai; eleyaasaarum iththaamaarumea thangga'l thagappanaagiya aaroanukku munbaaga aasaariya oozhiyam seythaarga'l. 
verse	4	3	5	karththar moaseayai noakki: 
verse	4	3	6	nee leavikoaththiraththaaraich searththu, avarga'l aasaariyanaagiya aaroanukkup pa'nividai seyyumpadi avarga'lai ni'ruththu. 
verse	4	3	7	avarga'l aasarippuk koodaaraththukku munbaaga avanudaiya kaavalaiyum ellaach sabaiyin kaavalaiyum kaaththu, vaasasthalaththin pa'nividai vealaiga'laich seyyakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	3	8	avarga'l aasarippuk koodaaraththin thattumuttu muthalaanavaiga'laiyum, israveal puththirarin kaavalaiyum kaaththu, vaasasthalaththin pa'nividaiga'laich seyyakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	3	9	aagaiyaal leaviyarai aaroanidaththilum avan kumaararidaththilum oppukkoduppaayaaga; israveal puththiraril ivarga'l mut'rilum avanukku oppukkodukkappattirukki'raarga'l. 
verse	4	3	10	aaroanaiyum avan kumaararaiyumoa, thangga'l aasaariya oozhiyaththaich seyvatha'rkaaga niyamikkakkadavaay, antha oozhiyaththaich seyyumpadi searugi'ra anniyan kolaiseyyappadakkadavan en'raar. 
verse	4	3	11	pinnum karththar moaseayai noakki: 
verse	4	3	12	israveal puththiraril karppanthi'ranthu pi'rakki'ra mutha'rpea'raana yaavukkum bathilaaga, naan leaviyarai israveal puththirarilirunthu eduththukko'ndean; avarga'l ennudaiyavarga'laayirukki'raarga'l. 
verse	4	3	13	mutha'rpea'raanavaiyellaam ennudaiyavai; naan egipthutheasaththil mutha'rpea'raana yaavaiyum sanggariththa naa'lil, isravealil manitharmuthal mirugajeevanmattumu'l'la mutha'rpea'raana yaavaiyum enakken'ru parisuththappaduththinathinaalea, avaiga'l ennudaiyavaiga'laayirukkum; naan karththar en'raar. 
verse	4	3	14	pinnum karththar seenaay vanaantharaththil moaseayai noakki: 
verse	4	3	15	leavipuththirarai avarga'l pithaakka'lin vamsangga'linpadiyea e'n'nuvaayaaga; avarga'lil oru maathammuthal atha'rku mea'rpatta vayathu'l'la aa'npi'l'laiga'laiyellaam e'n'nuvaayaaga en'raar. 
verse	4	3	16	appozhuthu karththarudaiya vaakkinpadi, moasea thanakkuk ka'rpikkappattapiragaaram avarga'lai e'n'ninaan. 
verse	4	3	17	leaviyin kumaarar thangga'l naamangga'linpadiyea, kersoan, koagaath, meraari enbavarga'l. 
verse	4	3	18	thangga'l vamsaththinpadiyea kersoanudaiya kumaararin naamangga'l, libnee, seemeayi enbavaiga'l. 
verse	4	3	19	thangga'l vamsangga'linpadiyea koagaaththudaiya kumaarar, amraam, ithseayaar, ebroan, oosiyeal enbavarga'l. 
verse	4	3	20	thangga'l vamsangga'linpadiyea meraariyinudaiya kumaarar, mageali, moosi enbavarga'l; ivarga'lea leaviyarudaiya pithaakka'lin vamsaththaar. 
verse	4	3	21	kersoanin vazhiyaay libneeyarin vamsamum seemeayiyar vamsamum thoan'rina; ivaiga'lea kersoaniyarin vamsangga'l. 
verse	4	3	22	avarga'lil oru maathammuthal atha'rku mea'rpatta vayathu'l'la aa'npi'l'laiga'lellaam e'n'nappattapoathu, e'n'nappattavarga'l eazhaayiraththu ainnoo'rupearaayirunthaarga'l. 
verse	4	3	23	kersoaniyarin vamsangga'l vaasasthalaththin pinpu'raththil mea'rkea paa'layami'ranggavea'ndum. 
verse	4	3	24	kersoaniyarudaiya thagappan vamsaththukkuth thalaivan laayealin kumaaranaagiya eliyaasaap enbavan. 
verse	4	3	25	aasarippuk koodaaraththilea kersoan puththirarin kaavalaavathu: vaasasthalamum, koodaaramum, athin moodiyum, aasarippuk koodaaravaasal ma'raivum, 
verse	4	3	26	vaasasthalaththa'ndaiyilum balipeedaththa'ndaiyilum sut'rilum irukki'ra piraagaaraththin thongguthiraiga'lum, piraagaaravaasal mooduthiraiyum, avaiga'lin vealaiga'lukkellaam uriya avaiga'lin kayi'ruga'lumea. 
verse	4	3	27	koagaaththin vazhiyaay amraamiyarin vamsamum ithseayaarin vamsamum ebroaniyarin vamsamum oosiyealarin vamsamum thoan'rina; ivaiga'lea koagaaththiyarin vamsangga'l. 
verse	4	3	28	oru maathammuthal atha'rku mea'rpatta vayathu'l'la aa'npi'l'laiga'lellaam e'n'nappattapoathu, parisuththa sthalaththukkuriyavaiga'laik kaappavarga'l, e'n'naayiraththu a'runoo'rupearaayirunthaarga'l. 
verse	4	3	29	koagaath puththirarin vamsangga'l vaasasthalaththin thenpu'ramaana pakkaththilea paa'layami'ranggavea'ndum. 
verse	4	3	30	avarga'lin thalaivan, oosiyealin kumaaranaagiya elsaapaan. 
verse	4	3	31	avarga'ludaiya kaavalaavathu: pettiyum, meajaiyum, kuththuvi'lakkum, peedangga'lum, aaraathanaikkeat'ra parisuththa sthalaththin pa'nimuttuga'lum, thongguthiraiyum, athinudaiya ellaa vealaiga'lukkum eat'ravaiga'lumea. 
