verse	4	6	23	nee aaroanoadum avan kumaararoadum sollavea'ndiyathu ennaven'raal: neengga'l israveal puththirarai aaseervathikkumpoathu, avarga'laip paarththuch sollavea'ndiyathaavathu: 
verse	4	6	24	karththar unnai aaseervathiththu, unnaik kaakkakkadavar. 
verse	4	6	25	karththar thammudaiya mugaththai unmeal piragaasikkappa'n'ni, unmeal kirubaiyaayirukkakkadavar. 
