verse	4	6	27	ivvithamaay avarga'l en naamaththai israveal puththirarmeal koo'rakkadavarga'l; appozhuthu naan avarga'lai aaseervathippean en'ru sol en'raar. 
verse	4	7	1	moasea vaasasthalaththai sthaabanampa'n'ni, athaiyum athin ellaap pa'nimuttuga'laiyum, balipeedaththaiyum athin ellaap pa'nimuttuga'laiyum abisheagampa'n'ni, parisuththappaduththi mudiththa naa'lil, 
verse	4	7	2	thangga'l pithaakka'ludaiya vamsaththalaivarum, e'n'nappattavarga'lin visaarippukku vaikkappatta koaththirap pirabukka'lumaagiya isravealin pirabukka'l kaa'nikkaiga'laich seluththinaarga'l. 
verse	4	7	3	thangga'l kaa'nikkaiyaaga, aa'ru koo'ndu va'ndilga'laiyum, pannira'ndu maaduga'laiyum, ira'ndira'ndu pirabukka'lukku ovvoru va'ndilum, ovvoru pirabukku ovvoru maadumaaga, karththarukkuch seluththa vaasasthalaththi'rku munbaagak ko'nduvanthaarga'l. 
