verse	4	10	3	avaiga'lai oothumpoathu, sabaiyaar ellaarum aasarippuk koodaaravaasalil unnidaththil koodivaravea'ndum. 
verse	4	10	4	on'raimaaththiram oothinaal isravealil aayiravarga'lukkuth thalaivaraagiya pirabukka'l unnidaththil koodivarakkadavarga'l. 
verse	4	10	5	neengga'l avaiga'laip perunthoniyaay muzhakkumpoathu, kizhakkea i'ranggiyirukki'ra paa'layangga'l pirayaa'nappadakkadavathu. 
verse	4	10	6	avaiga'lai neengga'l ira'ndaantharam perunthoniyaay muzhakkumpoathu, the'rkea i'ranggiyirukki'ra paa'layangga'l pirayaa'nappadakkadavathu; avarga'laip pirayaa'nappaduththuvatha'rkup perunthoniyaay muzhakkavea'ndum. 
verse	4	10	7	sabaiyaik koottugi'ratha'rku neengga'l oothavea'ndiyatheayan'ri perunthoniyaay muzhakkavea'ndaam. 
