verse	4	12	11	appozhuthu aaroan moaseayai noakki: aa, en aa'ndavanea, naangga'l buththiyeenamaaych seytha inthap paavaththai engga'lmeal sumaththaathirum. 
verse	4	12	12	than thaayin karppaththil paathi maamsam azhugich seththuvizhuntha pi'l'laiyaippoala ava'l aagaathiruppaa'laaga en'raan. 
verse	4	12	13	appozhuthu moasea karththarai noakki: en theavanea, ava'laik ku'namaakkum en'ru kegnchinaan. 
