verse	4	14	23	avarga'l pithaakka'lukku naan aa'naiyittukkoduththa theasaththaik kaa'namaattaarga'l; enakkuk koabam u'ndaakkinavarga'lil oruvarum athaik kaa'namaattaarga'l. 
verse	4	14	24	ennudaiya thaasanaagiya kaaleab vea'rea aaviyai udaiyavanaayirukki'rapadiyinaalum, uththamamaay ennaip pinpat'rivanthapadiyinaalum, avan poayvantha theasaththilea avanaich searappa'n'nuvean; avan santhathiyaar athaich suthanthariththukko'l'luvaarga'l. 
verse	4	14	25	amaleakkiyarum kaanaaniyarum pa'l'laththaakkilea kudiyirukki'rapadiyinaal, naa'laikku neengga'l thirumbich sivantha samuththiraththukkup poagi'ra vazhiyaay vanaantharaththukkup pirayaa'nampa'n'nungga'l en'raar. 
verse	4	14	26	pinnum karththar moaseayaiyum aaroanaiyum noakki: 
