verse	4	15	36	appozhuthu sabaiyaar ellaarum karththar moaseakkuk katta'laiyittapadiyea, avanaip paa'layaththi'rkup pu'rambea ko'ndupoayk kalle'rinthaarga'l; avan seththaan. 
verse	4	15	37	pinnum karththar moaseayai noakki: 
