verse	4	19	3	athai eleyaasaar ennum aasaariyanidaththil oppukkodungga'l; avan athaip paa'layaththukku ve'liyea ko'ndupoagakkadavan; anggea athu avanukku munbaagak kollappadakkadavathu. 
verse	4	19	4	appozhuthu aasaariyanaagiya eleyaasaar than viralinaal athin iraththaththil kogncham eduththu, aasarippuk koodaaraththukku ethiraaga eazhutharam the'likkakkadavan. 
verse	4	19	5	pinbu kidaariyai avan ka'nga'lukku munbaaga oruvan sutterikkavea'ndum; athin thoalum athin maamsamum athin iraththamum athin saa'niyum sutterikkappadavea'ndum. 
verse	4	19	6	appozhuthu aasaariyan keathuruk kattaiyaiyum eesoappaiyum sivappu noolaiyum eduththu, kidaari erikkappadugi'ra neruppin naduvilea poadakkadavan. 
verse	4	19	7	pinbu aasaariyan than vasthirangga'laith thoayththu, jalaththilea snaanampa'n'ni, athinpinbu paa'layaththil piraveasikkakkadavan; aasaariyan saayanggaalamattum theettuppattiruppaan. 
verse	4	19	8	athaich sutteriththavanum than vasthirangga'lai jalaththil thoayththu, jalaththilea snaanampa'n'ni, saayanggaalamattum theettuppattiruppaan. 
verse	4	19	9	suththamaayirukki'ra oruvan anthak kidaariyin saambalai vaarikko'ndu, paa'layaththi'rkup pu'rambea suththamaana oru idaththilea kottivaikkakkadavan; athu israveal puththirarin sabaikkaagath theettukkazhikkum jalaththukken'ru kaaththu vaikkappadavea'ndum; athu paavaththaip parigarikkum. 
verse	4	19	10	kidaariyin saambalai vaarinavan than vasthirangga'laith thoaykkakkadavan; avan saayanggaalamattum theettuppattiruppaan; ithu israveal puththirarukkum avarga'l naduvilea thanggugi'ra anniyanukkum niththiya katta'laiyaayiruppathaaga. 
verse	4	19	11	seththuppoanavanudaiya pireathaththaith thottavan eazhunaa'l theettuppattiruppaan. 
