verse	4	19	13	seththavanudaiya pireathaththaith thottum, thannaich suththigariththukko'l'laathavan karththarin vaasasthalaththaith theettuppaduththugi'raan; antha aaththumaa isravealil iraamal a'ruppu'ndupoavaan; theettukkazhikkum jalam avanmeal the'likkappadaathathinaal, avan theettuppattiruppaan; avan theettu innum avanmeal irukkum. 
verse	4	19	14	koodaaraththil oru manithan seththaal, atha'rkaduththa niyamamaavathu: anthak koodaaraththil piraveasikki'ra yaavarum koodaaraththil irukki'ra yaavarum eazhunaa'l theettuppattiruppaarga'l. 
verse	4	19	15	moodik kattappadaamal thi'ranthirukkum paaththirangga'l ellaam theettuppattirukkum. 
