verse	4	19	17	aagaiyaal theettuppattavanukkaaga, paavaththaip parigarikkum kidaariyin saambalilea kogncham eduththu, oru paaththiraththil poattu, athinmeal oot'ru jalam vaarkkavea'ndum. 
verse	4	19	18	suththamaana oruvan eesoappai eduththu, antha jalaththilea thoayththu, koodaaraththinmealum athilu'l'la sagala pa'nimuttuga'linmealum anggeayirukki'ra janangga'linmealum the'likki'rathumallaamal, elumbaiyaagilum vettu'ndavanaiyaagilum seththavanaiyaagilum pireathakkuzhiyaiyaagilum thottavanmealum the'likkakkadavan. 
verse	4	19	19	suththamaayirukki'ravan theettuppattavanmeal moon'raam naa'lilum eazhaam naa'lilum the'likkavea'ndum; eazhaam naa'lil ivan thannaich suththigariththu, than vasthirangga'laith thoayththu, jalaththil snaanampa'n'ni, saayanggaalaththilea suththamaayiruppaan. 
