verse	4	19	21	theettukkazhikkum jalaththaith the'likki'ravanum than vasthirangga'laith thoaykkakkadavan; theettukkazhikkum jalaththaith thottavanum saayanggaalamattum theettuppattiruppaan. 
verse	4	19	22	theettuppattirukki'ravan thodugi'ravaiga'lellaam theettuppadum, avaiga'laith thodugi'ravanum saayanggaalamattum theettuppattiruppaan; ithu ungga'lukku niththiya katta'laiyaayirukkum en'raar. 
verse	4	20	1	israveal puththirarin sabaiyaar ellaarum muthalaam maathaththil seenvanaantharaththilea searnthu, janangga'l kaatheasilea thanggiyirukkaiyil, miriyaam mara'namadainthu, anggea adakkampa'n'nappattaa'l. 
verse	4	20	2	janangga'lukkuth tha'n'neer illaathirunthathu; appozhuthu avarga'l moaseakkum aaroanukkum viroathamaagak koottangkoodinaarga'l. 
verse	4	20	3	janangga'l moaseayoadea vaakkuvaathampa'n'ni: engga'l sagoatharar karththarudaiya sannithiyil maa'ndapoathu naangga'lum maa'ndupoayirunthaal nalamaayirukkum. 
verse	4	20	4	naangga'lum engga'l mirugangga'lum inggea saagumpadi, neengga'l karththarin sabaiyai intha vanaantharaththilea ko'nduvanthathu enna; 
