verse	4	32	32	yoarthaanukku ikkaraiyilea engga'l suthantharaththin kaa'niyaadchi engga'lukku uriyathaagumpadi naangga'l karththarudaiya samugaththil yuththasannaththaraayk kaanaantheasaththi'rkup poavoam en'raarga'l. 
