verse	4	34	3	ungga'l thenpu'ram seenvanaantharam thodanggi eathoam theasaththin oaramattum irukkum; kizhakkea irukki'ra uppukkadalin kadaisi thodanggi ungga'l then ellaiyaayirukkum. 
verse	4	34	4	ungga'l ellai the'rkilirunthu akkaraabeem meaduga'laich sut'ri, seenvanaantharamvaraiyil poay, the'rkilea kaatheasbarneayaavukkum, anggeayirunthu aathsaar athaarukkum, anggeayirunthu asmoanaavukkum poay, 
verse	4	34	5	asmoanaavilirunthu egipthin nathivaraikkum sut'rippoayk kadalil mudiyum. 
verse	4	34	6	meat'risaikkup perungkadalea ungga'lukku ellai; athuvea ungga'lukku mea'rpu'raththu ellaiyaayirukkum. 
