verse	4	34	8	oar ennum malai thodanggi, aamaaththi'rkup poagi'ra vazhiyaik ku'rippaaga vaiththu, anggeayirunthu antha ellai seathaaththi'rkup poay, 
verse	4	34	9	anggeayirunthu athu siproanukkuppoay, aathsaar eanaanilea mudiyum; athuvea ungga'lukku vadapu'raththu ellaiyaayirukkum. 
