verse	4	34	12	anggeayirunthu yoarthaanpariyanthamum poay, uppukkadalil mudiyum; inthach sut'rellaiga'laiyudaiya theasamea ungga'lukkuriya theasam en'ru sol en'raar. 
verse	4	34	13	appozhuthu moasea israveal puththirarai noakki: onbatharaik koaththiraththaarukkuk kodukkumpadi karththar katta'laiyittathum, neengga'l seettuppoattuch suthanthariththukko'l'lavea'ndiyathumaana theasam ithuvea. 
