verse	5	15	18	avanai viduthalaiyaakki anuppividuvathu unakku visanamaayk kaa'nappadavea'ndaam; irattippaana koolikku eedaaga aa'ru varusham unnidaththil seaviththaanea; ippadi un theavanaagiya karththar nee seyyum ellaavat'rilum unnai aaseervathippaar. 
