verse	5	28	1	in'ru naan unakku vithikki'ra un theavanaagiya karththarudaiya katta'laiga'linpadiyellaam seyya nee kavanamaayirukkumpadikku, avar saththaththi'rku u'nmaiyaaych sevikoduppaayaanaal, un theavanaagiya karththar boomiyilu'l'la sagala jaathiga'lilum unnai meanmaiyaaga vaippaar. 
verse	5	28	2	nee un theavanaagiya karththarin saththaththukkuch sevikodukkumpoathu, ippozhuthu sollappadum aaseervaathangga'lellaam unmeal vanthu unakkup palikkum. 
