verse	7	7	14	appozhuthu mat'ravan: ithu yoavaasin kumaaranaagiya kithiyoan ennum isravealanudaiya pattayamea allaamal vea'ralla; theavan meethiyaaniyaraiyum, inthach seanai anaiththaiyum avan kaiyilea oppukkoduththaar en'raan. 
