verse	7	7	17	avarga'lai noakki: naan seyvathaip paarththu, appadiyea neengga'lum seyyungga'l. ithoa, naan paa'layaththin munna'niyil vanthirukkumpoathu, naan eppadich seygi'reanoa appadiyea neengga'lum seyyavea'ndum. 
