verse	7	7	25	meethiyaaniyarin ira'ndu athibathiga'laagiya oareabaiyum seabaiyum pidiththu, oareabai oareab ennappatta kanmalaiyilum, seabai seab ennappatta aalaiyilum kon'rupoattu, meethiyaaniyaraith thuraththi, oareab seab enbavarga'lin thalaiga'lai yoarthaanukku ikkaraiyiliruntha kithiyoanidaththukkuk ko'nduvanthaarga'l. 
verse	7	8	1	appozhuthu eppiraayeem manushar avanai noakki: nee meethiyaaniyarmeal yuththampa'n'nappoagi'rapoathu, engga'lai azhaippikkavillaiyea, ippadi nee engga'lukkuch seythathu enna en'ru, avanoadea balaththa vaakkuvaathampa'n'ninaarga'l. 
verse	7	8	2	atha'rku avan: neengga'l seythatha'rku naan seythathu emmaaththiram? abiyeasriyarin thiraadchappazhaththin muzhu a'ruppaippaarkkilum, eppiraayeemarin meethiyaana a'ruppu athigam allavaa? 
