verse	7	8	27	athinaal kithiyoan oru eaboaththai u'ndaakki, athaith than ooraana opraavilea vaiththaan; isravealarellaarum athaip pinpat'rich soarampoanaarga'l; athu kithiyoanukkum avan veettaarukkum ka'n'niyaayit'ru. 
verse	7	8	28	inthappiragaaram meethiyaaniyar thirumba thalaiyedukkakkoodaathapadikku, israveal puththirarukku munbaagath thaazhththappattaarga'l; theasamaanathu kithiyoanin naadka'lil naa'rpathuvarusham amaithalaayirunthathu. 
