verse	8	1	6	karththar thammudaiya janangga'laich santhiththu, avarga'lukku aagaaram aru'linaar en'ru ava'l moavaabtheasaththilea kea'lvippattu, than marumakka'loadeakooda moavaab theasaththilirunthu thirumbivarumpadi ezhunthu, 
verse	8	1	7	than ira'ndu marumakka'loadungkoodath thaaniruntha sthalaththai vittup pu'rappattaa'l. yoothaa theasaththi'rkuth thirumbippoaga, avarga'l vazhinadakkaiyil, 
