verse	8	2	8	appozhuthu boavaas rooththaippaarththu: maga'lea, kea'l; po'rukkikko'l'la vea'rea vayalil poagaamalum, ivvidaththaivittup poagaamalum, inggea en oozhiyakkaarap pe'nga'loadukoodavea iru. 
