verse	9	3	16	ealiyoa: saamuvealea, en maganea en'ru saamuvealaik kooppittaan. avan: ithoa, irukki'rean en'raan. 
verse	9	3	17	appozhuthu avan: karththar unnidaththil sonna kaariyam enna? enakku athai ma'raikkavea'ndaam; avar unnidaththil sonna sagala kaariyaththilum yaathon'rai enakku ma'raiththaayaanaal, theavan unakku atha'rkuch sariyaagavum atha'rku athigamaagavum seyvaaraaga en'raan. 
verse	9	3	18	appozhuthu saamuveal on'raiyum avanukku ma'raikkaamal, anthak kaariyangga'laiyellaam avanukku a'riviththaan. atha'rku avan: avar karththar; avar thamathu paarvaikku nalamaanathaich seyvaaraaga en'raan. 
verse	9	3	19	saamuveal va'larnthaan; karththar avanudaneakooda irunthaar; avar thammudaiya ellaa vaarththaiga'lilum on'raiyaagilum tharaiyilea vizhunthupoaga vidavillai. 
verse	9	3	20	saamuveal karththarudaiya theerkkatharisithaan en'ru thaa'nmuthal beyersebaamattumu'l'la sagala isravealarukkum vi'langginathu. 
verse	9	3	21	karththar pinnum seeloavilea tharisanam thantharu'linaar; karththar seeloavilea thammudaiya vaarththaiyinaalea saamuvealukkuth thammai ve'lippaduththinaar. 
verse	9	4	1	saamuvealin vaarththai isravealukkellaam vanthathu. isravealar pelistharukku viroathamaay yuththagn seyyappu'rappattu, ebeneasarukkuch sameebaththil paa'layami'rangginaarga'l; pelistharoa aappekkilea paa'layami'ranggiyirunthaarga'l. 
verse	9	4	2	pelisthar isravealarukku viroathamaay a'nivaguththu nin'raarga'l; yuththam athigariththu, isravealar pelistharukku munbaaga mu'riya adikkappattaarga'l; avarga'l seanaiyil poarkka'laththilea ea'rakku'raiya naalaayirampear vettu'ndupoanaarga'l. 
verse	9	4	3	janangga'l thirumbap paa'layaththukku vanthapoathu, isravealin moopparaanavarga'l, in'ru karththar pelistharukku munbaaga nammai mu'riya adiththathenna? seeloavilirukki'ra karththarudaiya udanpadikkaippettiyaik ko'nduvaruvoam; athu nammai nammudaiya pagaignarin kaikku vilakki radchikkumpadi, nammudaiya naduvilea varavea'ndiyathu en'raarga'l. 
verse	9	4	4	appadiyea kearubeenga'lin maththiyilea vaasamaayirukki'ra seanaiga'lin karththarudaiya udanpadikkaippettiyai eduththuvara, janangga'l seeloavukkuch solliyanuppinaarga'l; anggea ealiyin ira'ndu kumaararaagiya oapniyum pinegaasum theavanudaiya udanpadikkaip pettiya'ndaiyil irunthaarga'l. 
verse	9	4	5	karththarudaiya udanpadikkaippetti paa'layaththilea varugi'rapoathu, isravealarellaarum boomi athiraththakkathaaga mahaa aarpparippaaych saththamittaarga'l. 
verse	9	4	6	avarga'l aarpparikki'ra saththaththaip pelisthar keattapoathu: ebireyarudaiya paa'layaththil intha mahaa aarpparippin saththam enna en'raarga'l; pinbu karththarin petti paa'layaththil vanthathu en'ru a'rinthuko'ndaarga'l. 
verse	9	4	7	theavan paa'layaththil vanthaar en'ru sollappattapadiyinaal, pelisthar bayanthu, aiyoa, namakku moasam vanthathu; itha'rkumun orupoathum ippadi nadakkavillaiyea. 
verse	9	4	8	aiyoa, antha magaththuvamaana theavarga'lin kaikku nammaith thappuvippavar yaar? egipthiyaraich sagalavitha vaathaiga'linaalum vanaantharaththilea adiththa theavarga'l ivarga'lthaanea. 
verse	9	4	9	pelistharea, thidangko'ndu purusharaippoala nadanthuko'l'lungga'l; ebireyar ungga'lukku adimaiga'laayirunthathupoala, neengga'lum avarga'lukku adimaiga'laagaathapadikku, purusharaayirunthu, yuththampa'n'nungga'l en'ru sollikko'ndaarga'l. 
verse	9	4	10	appozhuthu pelisthar yuththampa'n'ninaarga'l; isravealar mu'rinthu, avaravar thangga'l koodaarangga'lukku oadippoanaarga'l; mahaa periya sanggaaram u'ndaayit'ru; isravealilea muppathinaayiram kaalaadka'l vizhunthaarga'l. 
verse	9	4	11	theavanudaiya petti pidikkappattathu; ealiyin ira'ndu kumaararaagiya oapniyum pinegaasum maa'ndaarga'l. 
verse	9	4	12	benyameen koaththiraththaanaagiya oruvan padaiyilirunthu oadi, than vasthirangga'laik kizhiththu, than thalaiyinmeal puzhuthiyai vaarip poattukko'ndu, an'raiyathinamea seeloavukku vanthaan. 
verse	9	4	13	avan vanthapoathu: eali oru aasanaththinmeal udkaarnthu vazhiyaip paarththukko'ndirunthaan; theavanudaiya pettikkaaga avan iruthayam thaththa'liththukko'ndirunthathu. oorilea seythiyai a'rivikka antha manushan vanthapoathu, oorenggum pulambal u'ndaayit'ru. 
verse	9	4	14	pulambugi'ra inthach saththaththai eali keattapoathu: intha ama'liyin iraichchal enna en'ru keattaan; appozhuthu antha manushan theeviriththu vanthu, ealikku a'riviththaan. 
verse	9	4	15	eali tho'n'noot'rettu vayathu'l'lavanaayirunthaan; avan paarkkakkoodaathapadikku, avan ka'nga'l manggalaayirunthathu. 
verse	9	4	16	antha manushan ealiyaip paarththu: padaiyilirunthu vanthavan naanthaan; in'ru thaan padaiyilirunthu oadivanthean en'raan. appozhuthu avan: en maganea, nadantha kaariyam enna en'ru keattaan. 
verse	9	4	17	seythi ko'nduvanthavan pirathiyuththaramaaga: isravealar pelistharukku munbaaga mu'rinthoadippoanaarga'l; janangga'lukku'l'lea periya sanggaaram u'ndaayit'ru; ummudaiya kumaararaagiya oapni pinegaas ennum iruvarum i'ranthupoanaarga'l; theavanudaiya pettiyum pidipattuppoayit'ru en'raan. 
verse	9	4	18	avan theavanudaiya pettiyaik ku'riththuch sonnavudanea, eali aasanaththilirunthu vaasalin pakkamaay mallaakka vizhunthaan; avan kizhavanum sthooliththavanumaayirunthapadiyaal, avan pidari mu'rinthu seththuppoanaan. avan isravealai naa'rpathu varusham niyaayam visaariththaan. 
verse	9	4	19	pinegaasin manaiviyaagiya avan marumaga'l ni'raikarppi'niyaayirunthaa'l; ava'l theavanudaiya petti pidipatta seythiyaiyum, than maamanum than purushanum i'ranthu poanathaiyum kea'lvippattapoathu, ava'l karppaveathanaippattu kuninthu pirasaviththaa'l. 
verse	9	4	20	ava'l saagappoagi'ra nearaththil ava'la'ndaiyilea nin'ra sthireega'l: nee bayappadaathea, aa'npi'l'laiyaip pet'raay en'raarga'l; ava'loa atha'rku on'rum sollavumillai, athinmeal sinthaivaikkavumillai. 
verse	9	4	21	theavanudaiya petti pidipattu, ava'ludaiya maamanum ava'ludaiya purushanum i'ranthupoanapadiyinaal, ava'l: magimai isravealai vittuppoayit'ru en'ru solli, anthap pi'l'laikku ikkaboath en'ru pearittaa'l. 
verse	9	4	22	theavanudaiya petti pidipattup poanapadiyinaal, magimai isravealai vittu vilagippoayit'ru en'raa'l. 
