verse	9	6	3	atha'rku avarga'l: isravealin theavanudaiya pettiyai neengga'l anuppinaal, athai ve'rumaiyaay anuppaamal, kut'ranivaara'na kaa'nikkaiyai evvithaththilum avarukkuch seluththavea'ndum; appozhuthu neengga'l sosthamadaigi'rathum allaamal, avarudaiya kai ungga'lai vidaathiruntha mugaantharam innathu en'rum ungga'lukkuth theriyavarum en'raarga'l. 
verse	9	6	4	atha'rku avarga'l: kut'ranivaara'na kaa'nikkaiyaaga naangga'l avarukku ennaththaich seluththavea'ndumen'ru keattatha'rku, avarga'l: ungga'lellaarukkum ungga'l athibathiga'lukkum orea vaathaiyu'ndaanapadiyaal, pelistharudaiya athibathiga'lin ilakkaththi'rkuch sariyaaga moolaviyaathiyin saayalaanapadi seytha ainthu pon suroobangga'lum, ponnaal seytha ainthu su'ndeliga'lum seluththavea'ndum. 
verse	9	6	5	aagaiyaal ungga'l moolaviyaathiyin saayalaana suroobangga'laiyum, ungga'l theasaththaik keduththuppoatta su'ndeliga'lin saayalaana suroobangga'laiyum neengga'l u'ndupa'n'ni, isravealin theavanukku magimaiyaich seluththungga'l; appozhuthu oruvea'lai ungga'lmealum, ungga'l theavarga'lmealum, ungga'l theasaththinmealum i'ranggiyirukki'ra avarudaiya kai ungga'lai vittu vilagum. 
verse	9	6	6	egipthiyarum paarvoanum thangga'l iruthayaththaik kadinappaduththinathupoala, neengga'l ungga'l iruthayaththaik kadinappaduththuvaanean? avarga'lai avar theenggaay vaathiththapinbu, janangga'lai avarga'l anuppivittathum, avarga'l poayvittathum illaiyoa? 
verse	9	6	7	ippoathum neengga'l oru puthuva'ndil seythu, nugam poottaathirukki'ra ira'ndu ka'ravaippasukka'laip pidiththu, avaiga'lai va'ndililea katti, avaiga'lin kan'rukkuttiga'lai avaiga'lukkup pinnaagap poagavidaamal, veettilea ko'nduvanthu vittu, 
verse	9	6	8	pinbu karththarudaiya pettiyai eduththu, athai va'ndilinmeal vaiththu, neengga'l kut'ranivaara'nakaa'nikkaiyaaga avarukkuch seluththum ponnuruppadiga'lai athin pakkaththil oru si'riya pettiyilea vaiththu, athai anuppividungga'l. 
verse	9	6	9	appozhuthu paarungga'l; athu than ellaikkup poagi'ravazhiyaayp bethshimeasukkup poanaal, inthap periya theenggai namakkuch seythavar avarthaamea en'ru a'riyalaam; poagaathirunthaal, avarudaiya kai nammaith thodaamal, athu tha'rseyalaay namakku nearittathu en'ru a'rinthuko'l'lalaam en'raarga'l. 
