verse	9	6	13	bethshimeasin manushar pa'l'laththaakkilea koathumai a'ruppu a'ruththukko'ndirunthaarga'l; avarga'l thangga'l ka'nga'lai ea'redukkumpoathu, pettiyaik ka'ndu, athaik ka'ndathinaal santhoashappattaarga'l. 
