verse	9	6	15	leaviyar karththarudaiya pettiyaiyum, athanoadiruntha ponnuruppadiga'lu'l'la si'riya pettiyaiyum i'rakki, anthap periya kallinmeal vaiththaarga'l; bethshimeasin manushar, an'raiyathinam karththarukkuch sarvaangga thaganangga'laich seluththip baliga'lai ittaarga'l. 
verse	9	6	16	pelistharin ainthu athibathiga'lum ivaiga'laikka'ndu, an'raiyathinam ekroanukkuth thirumbippoanaarga'l. 
