verse	9	7	6	avarga'l appadiyea mispaavilea koodivanthu tha'n'neer mo'ndu, karththarudaiya sannithiyil oot'ri, an'raiyathinam ubavaasampa'n'ni, karththarukku viroathamaayp paavagnseythoam en'ru anggea sonnaarga'l; mispaavilea saamuveal israveal puththirarai niyaayam visaariththukko'ndirunthaan. 
verse	9	7	7	israveal puththirar mispaavilea koodivanthathaip pelisthar kea'lvippattapoathu, pelistharin athibathiga'l isravealukku viroathamaaga ethirththu vanthaarga'l; athai israveal puththirar keattu, pelistharinimiththam bayappattu, 
verse	9	7	8	saamuvealai noakki: nammudaiya theavanaagiya karththar engga'laip pelistharin kaikku neenggalaakki radchikkumpadikku, engga'lukkaaga avarai noakki oayaamal vea'ndikko'l'lum en'raarga'l. 
