verse	10	12	27	thaaveethinidaththil aa'l anuppi, naan rabbaavinmeal yuththampa'n'ni, tha'n'neer oaramaana patta'naththaip pidiththukko'ndean. 
verse	10	12	28	naan patta'naththaip pidikki'rathinaal, en pear vazhanggaathapadikku, neer mat'ra janangga'laik koottikko'nduvanthu, patta'naththai mut'rikkaipoattu, pidikkavea'ndum en'ru sollachsonnaan. 
verse	10	12	29	appadiyea thaaveethu janangga'laiyellaam koottikko'ndu, rabbaavukkuppoay, athinmeal yuththampa'n'ni, athaip pidiththaan. 
