verse	10	20	20	yoavaab pirathiyuththaramaaga: vizhunggavea'ndum azhikkavea'ndum engi'ra aasai enakku veguthooramaayiruppathaaga. 
verse	10	20	21	kaariyam appadiyalla, bikkiriyin kumaaranaagiya seabaa ennum pearu'l'la eppiraayeem parvathaththaanaayirukki'ra oru manushan, raajaavaagiya thaaveethukku viroathamaayth than kaiyai oangginaan; avanaimaaththiram oppukkodungga'l; appozhuthu patta'naththai vittuppoavean en'raan. appozhuthu antha sthiree yoavaabaip paarththu: ithoa, avan thalai mathilinmealirunthu ummidaththilea poadappadum en'ru solli, 
verse	10	20	22	ava'l janangga'lidaththil poayp buththiyaayp peasinathinaal, avarga'l bikkiriyin kumaaranaagiya seabaavin thalaiyai vetti, yoavaabidaththilea poattaarga'l; appozhuthu avan ekkaa'lam oothinaan; avaravar patta'naththai vittuk kalainthu, thangga'l koodaarangga'lukkup pu'rappattuppoanaarga'l; yoavaabum raajaavidaththukkup poagumpadi erusaleamukkuth thirumbinaan. 
