verse	10	21	15	pinbu pelisthar isravealinmeal yuththamseythaarga'l; appozhuthu thaaveethum avanoadeakooda avan seavagarumpoay, pelistharoadu yuththampa'n'ninaarga'l; thaaveethu vidaayththuppoanaan. 
verse	10	21	16	appozhuthu munnoo'ru seakkalni'rai ve'ngalamaana eettiyaip pidikki'ravanum, puthuppattayaththai araiyilea kattikko'ndavanumaana isbibenoab ennum iraadchatha puththiraril oruvan thaaveethai vettavea'ndum en'ru irunthaan. 
verse	10	21	17	seruyaavin kumaaranaagiya abisaay raajaavukku uthaviyaaga vanthu, pelisthanai vettik kon'rupoattaan. appozhuthu thaaveethin manushar: isravealin vi'lakku a'nainthupoagaathapadikku, neer ini engga'loadea yuththaththi'rkup pu'rappadavea'ndaam en'ru avanukku aa'naiyittuch sonnaarga'l. 
verse	10	21	18	atha'rkup pinbu pelistharoadea thirumbavum koabilea yuththam nadanthathu; oosaaththiyanaagiya seebeakkaay iraadchatha santhathiyaana saappai vettippoattaan. 
verse	10	21	19	pelistharoadu innum vea'roru yuththam koabilea u'ndaanapoathu, yaareyorkimin kumaaranaagiya elkkaanaan ennum bethleheamiyan kaath ooraanaagiya koaliyaaththin sagoatharanai vettinaan; avan eettith thaanggaanathu neygi'ravarga'lin padaimaram avva'lavu perithaayirunthathu. 
verse	10	21	20	innum oru yuththam kaath oorilea nadanthapoathu, anggea nettaiyanaana oru manushan irunthaan; avan kaiga'lil avvaa'ru viralga'lum avan kaalga'lil avvaa'ru viralga'lum, aaga irubaththu naangu viralga'lu'l'lavan; ivanum iraadchatha pi'raviyaayirunthu, 
verse	10	21	21	isravealai ninthiththaan; thaaveethin sagoatharanaana seemeayaavin kumaaranaagiya yoanaththaan avanai vettinaan. 
verse	10	21	22	intha naalupearum kaaththoorilea iraadchathanukkup pi'ranthavarga'l; ivarga'l thaaveethin kaiyinaalum avan seavagarin kaiyinaalum madinthaarga'l. 
verse	10	22	1	karththar thaaveethai avanudaiya ellaach saththurukka'lin kaikkum, savulin kaikkum, neenggalaakki viduviththapoathu, avan karththarukku munbaagap paadina paattu: 
