verse	11	13	18	atha'rku avan: ummaippoala naanum theerkkatharisithaan; avan appam pusiththuth tha'n'neer kudikka, nee avanaith thiruppi, un veettukku azhaiththukko'nduvaa en'ru oru thoothan karththarudaiya vaarththaiyaaga ennoadea sonnaan en'ru avanidaththil poysonnaan. 
