verse	11	13	24	avan poanapi'rpaadu vazhiyilea oru singgam avanukku ethirppattu avanaik kon'rupoattathu; avan pireatham vazhiyilea kidanthathu; kazhuthai athina'ndaiyilea nin'rathu; singgamum pireathaththa'ndaiyilea nin'rathu. 
verse	11	13	25	antha vazhiyea kadanthuvarugi'ra manushar, vazhiyilea kidakki'ra pireathaththaiyum, pireathaththa'ndaiyilea ni'rki'ra singgaththaiyum ka'ndu, kizhavanaana theerkkatharisi kudiyiruntha patta'naththilea vanthu sonnaarga'l. 
