verse	11	14	4	appadiyea yerobeyaamin manaivi seythaa'l; ava'l ezhunthu seeloavukkup poay, agiyaavin veetti'rku'l piraveasiththaa'l; agiyaavoa muthir vayathaanathinaal avan ka'nga'l manggaladainthu paarkkakkoodaathirunthaan. 
verse	11	14	5	karththar agiyaavinidaththil: ithoa, yerobeyaamin manaivi viyaathiyaayirukki'ra than kumaaranukkaaga unnai oru viseashamkeadka varugi'raa'l; nee ava'lukku inna inna piragaaramaagach sollavea'ndum; ava'l udpiraveasikki'rapoathu, thannai anniya sthireeyaagak kaa'nbippaa'l en'raar. 
