verse	14	1	10	ippoathum naan intha janaththi'rku munbaagap poakkum varaththumaayirukkaththakka gnaanaththaiyum a'rivaiyum enakkuth thantharu'lum; earaa'lamaayirukki'ra intha ummudaiya janaththai niyaayam visaarikkaththakkavan yaar en'raan. 
verse	14	1	11	appozhuthu theavan saalomoanai noakki: intha viruppam un iruthayaththil irunthapadiyaalum, nee aisuvariyaththaiyum sambaththaiyum kanaththaiyum, un pagaignarin piraa'nanaiyum, neediththa aayusaiyum kea'laamal, naan unnai arasaa'lappa'n'nina en janaththai niyaayam visaarikkaththakka gnaanaththaiyum viveagaththaiyum nee keattapadiyinaalum, 
verse	14	1	12	gnaanamum viveagamum thanthirukki'rathumallaamal, unakkumun iruntha raajaakka'lukkaagilum unakkuppin irukkum raajaakka'lukkaagilum illaatha aisuvariyaththaiyum sambaththaiyum kanaththaiyum unakkuth tharuvean en'raar. 
verse	14	1	13	ippadich saalomoan kibiyoanilirukki'ra meatti'rkup poay, aasarippuk koodaaraththin sannithiyilirunthu erusaleamukku vanthu, isravealai arasaa'ndaan. 
verse	14	1	14	saalomoan irathangga'laiyum kuthiraiveeraraiyum searththaan; avanukku aayiraththu naanoo'ru irathangga'l irunthathu; panneeraayiram kuthiraiveerarum irunthaarga'l; avaiga'lai irathangga'lin patta'nangga'lilum, avarga'lai raajaavaagiya thannidaththil erusaleamilum vaiththirunthaan. 
verse	14	1	15	raajaa erusaleamilea ve'l'liyaiyum ponnaiyum ka'rka'lpoalavum, keathurumarangga'laip pa'l'laththaakkil irukki'ra kaattaththimarangga'lpoalavum athigamaakkinaan. 
verse	14	1	16	saalomoanukku iruntha kuthiraiga'lum pudavaiga'lum egipthilirunthu ko'nduvarappattathu; raajaavin varththagar pudavaiga'lai oppantha vilaikkirayaththukku vaangginaarga'l. 
verse	14	1	17	avarga'l egipthilirunthu oru irathaththai a'runoo'ru ve'l'likkaasukkum, oru kuthiraiyai noot'raimbathu ve'l'likkaasukkum ko'nduvaruvaarga'l; anthappadiyea eaththiyarin sagala raajaakka'lukkum, seeriyaavin raajaakka'lukkum avarga'l moolamaayk ko'nduvarappattathu. 
verse	14	2	1	saalomoan karththarudaiya naamaththi'rku oru aalayaththaiyum, than raajarigaththi'rku oru aramanaiyaiyum katta nir'nayampa'n'ni, 
verse	14	2	2	sumaisumakki'ratha'rku ezhubathinaayirampearaiyum, malaiyil maram vettugi'ratha'rku e'nbathinaayirampearaiyum, ivarga'lmeal thalaivaraaga moovaayiraththu a'runoo'rupearaiyum e'n'ni ea'rpaduththinaan. 
verse	14	2	3	theeruvin raajaavaagiya eeraamidaththil aa'l anuppi: en thagappanaagiya thaaveethu thaam vaasamaayirukkum aramanaiyaith thamakkuk kattumpadikku, neer avarukkuth thayavuseythu, avarukkuk keathurumarangga'lai anuppinathupoala enakkum thayavuseyyum. 
verse	14	2	4	ithoa, en theavanaagiya karththarukku munbaagach suganthavarkkangga'lin thoobam kaattugi'ratha'rkum, samugaththappangga'lai eppoathum vaikki'ratha'rkum, kaalaiyilum maalaiyilum, oayvunaadka'lilum, maathappi'rappuga'lilum, engga'l theavanaagiya karththarin pa'ndigaiga'lilum, israveal niththiyakaalamaagach seluththavea'ndiyapadi sarvaangga thaganabaliga'laich seluththugi'ratha'rkum, avarudaiya naamaththi'rku oru aalayaththaik katti athai avarukkup pirathishdaipa'n'numpadi naan eththaniththirukki'rean. 
verse	14	2	5	engga'l theavan ellaa theavarga'laippaarkkilum periyavar; aagaiyaal naan kattappoagi'ra aalayam periyathaayirukkum. 
verse	14	2	6	vaanangga'lum vaanaathivaanangga'lum avaraik ko'l'lakkoodaathirukka, avarukku oru aalayaththaik katta vallavan yaar? avar sannithiyil thoobangkaattugi'ratha'rkea ozhiya, vea'rea mugaantharamaay avarukku aalayamkattugi'ratha'rku naan emmaaththiram? 
verse	14	2	7	ippoathum en thagappanaagiya thaaveethu ku'riththavarga'lum, ennidaththil yoothaavilum erusaleamilum irukki'ravarga'lumaagiya nibu'naroadu, ponnilum ve'l'liyilum ve'ngalaththilum irumbilum iraththaambaranoolilum sivappunoolilum i'laneelanoolilum vealaiseyya nibu'nanum, koththuvealaiseyya a'rinthavanumaagiya oru manushanai ennidaththil anuppum. 
verse	14	2	8	leebanoanilirunthu keathurumarangga'laiyum, theavathaari virudchangga'laiyum, vaasanai marangga'laiyum enakku anuppum; leebanoanin marangga'lai vetta ummudaiya vealaikkaarar pazhaginavarga'len'ru a'rivean; enakku marangga'laith thira'laaga aayaththappaduththa en vealaikkaarar ummudaiya vealaikkaararoadungkooda iruppaarga'l. 
verse	14	2	9	naan kattappoagi'ra aalayam periyathum aachchariyappadaththakkathumaayirukkum. 
verse	14	2	10	antha marangga'lai vettugi'ra ummudaiya vealaikkaararukku irubathinaayiram marakkaal koathumai arisiyaiyum, irubathinaayiram marakkaal vaa'rkoathumaiyaiyum, irubathinaayiram kudam thiraadcharasaththaiyum, irubathinaayiram kudam e'n'neyaiyum koduppean en'ru solli anuppinaan. 
verse	14	2	11	appozhuthu theeruvin raajaavaagiya eeraam saalomoanukkup pirathiyuththaramaaga: karththar thammudaiya janaththaich sineagiththathinaal, ummai avarga'lmeal raajaavaaga vaiththaar. 
verse	14	2	12	karththarukku oru aalayaththaiyum, thamathu raajarigaththi'rku oru aramanaiyaiyum kattaththakka yukthiyum buththiyumudaiya gnaanamu'l'la kumaaranai, thaaveethuraajaavukkuk katta'laiyittavaraagiya vaanaththaiyum boomiyaiyum u'ndaakkina isravealin theavanaagiya karththarukku sthoaththiramu'ndaavathaaga. 
verse	14	2	13	ippoathum eeraam abiyennum buththimaanaagiya nibu'nanai anuppugi'rean. 
verse	14	2	14	avan thaa'nin kumaaraththiga'lil oru sthireeyin kumaaran; avan thagappan theerutheasaththaan; avan ponnilum, ve'l'liyilum, ve'ngalaththilum, irumbilum, ka'rka'lilum, marangga'lilum, iraththaambaranoolilum i'laneelanoolilum melliyanoolilum sivappunoolilum vealaiseyyavum, sagalavithak koththuvealai seyyavum, ennenna seyyavea'ndumen'ru avanukkuch sollappadumoa, avaiga'laiyellaam ummidaththilu'l'la nibu'naroadum, ummudaiya thagappanaagiya thaaveethu ennum en aa'ndavanin nibu'naroadungkooda yoogiththuch seyyavum a'rinthavan. 
verse	14	2	15	en aa'ndavan thaam sonnapadi koathumaiyaiyum, vaa'rkoathumaiyaiyum, e'n'neyaiyum, thiraadcharasaththaiyum thammudaiya oozhiyakkaararukku anuppuvaaraaga. 
verse	14	2	16	naangga'l umakkuth theavaiyaana marangga'laiyellaam leebanoanilea vetti, avaiga'laith theppangga'laayk kattik kadalvazhiyaay yoappaamattum ko'nduvaruvoam; pi'rpaadu neer avaiga'lai erusaleamukkuk ko'ndupoagalaam en'ru ezhuthi anuppinaan. 
verse	14	2	17	than thagappanaagiya thaaveethu israveal theasaththilu'ndaana ma'rujaathiyaaraiyellaam e'n'nith thogaiyittathupoala, saalomoanum avarga'lai e'n'ninaan; avarga'l ladchaththu aimbaththumoovaayiraththu a'runoo'rupearaayirunthaarga'l. 
verse	14	2	18	ivarga'lil avan ezhubathinaayirampearaich sumaisumakkavum, e'nbathinaayirampearai malaiyil maramvettavum, moovaayiraththu a'runoo'rupearai janaththin vealaiyai visaarikkum thalaivaraayirukkavum vaiththaan. 
verse	14	3	1	pinbu saalomoan erusaleamilea than thagappanaagiya thaaveethukkuk kaa'nbikkappatta moariyaa ennum malaiyil eboosiyanaagiya ornaanin ka'lam ennum thaaveethu ku'riththuvaiththa sthalaththilea karththarudaiya aalayaththaik kattaththuvakkinaan. 
verse	14	3	2	avan thaan raajyabaarampa'n'nina naalaam varusham ira'ndaam maatham ira'ndaam theathiyilea kattaththodangginaan. 
