verse	14	3	4	mugappu ma'ndabam aalayaththinudaiya agalaththinpadiyea irubathumuzha nee'lamum, noot'rirubathumuzha uyaramumaayirunthathu; athin udpu'raththaip pasumponthagattaal moodinaan. 
verse	14	3	5	aalayaththin periya maa'ligaiyaith theavathaaru palagaiga'linaal seythu pasumponninaal izhaiththu, athinmeal peareechchuvealaiyaiyum sanggilivealaiyaiyum siththiriththu, 
verse	14	3	6	antha maa'ligaiyai raththinangga'laal alanggariththaan; ponnaanathu parvaayeemin ponnaayirunthathu. 
verse	14	3	7	antha maa'ligaiyin uththirangga'laiyum, nilaiga'laiyum, athin suvarga'laiyum, athin kathavuga'laiyum ponthagattaal moodi, koththuvealaiyaal suvarga'lilea kearubeenga'laich seyviththaan. 
verse	14	3	8	mahaa parisuththamaana aalayaththaiyum kattinaan; athin nee'lam aalayaththinudaiya agalaththinpadi irubathumuzhamum, athin agalam irubathumuzhamumaayirunthathu; athai a'runoo'ru thaalanthu pasumponninaal izhaiththaan. 
verse	14	3	9	aa'niga'lin ni'rai aimbathu pon seakkalaanathu; meal a'raiga'laiyum ponninaal izhaiththaan. 
