verse	14	3	11	anthak kearubeenga'ludaiya settaiga'lin nee'lam irubathu muzhamaanathu; on'rinudaiya oru settai ainthumuzhamaayirunthu, aalayaththuch suvaraith thottathu; ma'rusettai ainthumuzhamaayirunthu, mat'rak kearubeenin settaiyaith thottathu. 
verse	14	3	12	mat'rak kearubeenin oru settaiyum ainthumuzhamaayirunthu, aalayaththuchsuvaraith thottathu; athin ma'ru settaiyum ainthumuzhamaayirunthu, mat'rak kearubeenin settaiyaith thottathu. 
verse	14	3	13	ippadiyea anthak kearubeenga'lin settaiga'l irubathumuzha virivaayirunthana; avaiga'l thangga'l kaalga'laal oon'ri nin'rana; avaiga'lin mugangga'l aalayaththu udpu'ramaay noakkiyirunthathu. 
verse	14	3	14	i'laneelanoolaalum iraththaambaranoolaalum sivappunoolaalum melliya noolaalum thiraiyaiyum, athilea kearubeenga'lin uruvangga'laiyum u'ndupa'n'ninaan. 
