verse	14	3	17	anthath thoo'nga'lai avan theavaalayaththi'rku munbaaga on'rai valathupu'raththilum on'rai idathupu'raththilum naatti, valathupu'ramaanatha'rku yaakeen en'rum, idathupu'ramaanatha'rkup boavaas en'rum pearittaan. 
verse	14	4	1	an'riyum irubathumuzha nee'lamum irubathumuzha agalamum paththumuzha uyaramumaana ve'ngalap balipeedaththaiyum pa'n'ninaan. 
