verse	14	4	8	paththu meajaiga'laiyum seythu, avaiga'laith theavaalayaththil valathupu'raththilea ainthum idathupu'raththilea ainthumaaga vaiththu, noo'ru pon kalangga'laiyum pa'n'ninaan. 
