verse	14	5	7	appadiyea aasaariyar karththarudaiya udanpadikkaip pettiyai, aalayaththin sannithiyaagiya mahaa parisuththamaana sthalaththilea, kearubeenga'ludaiya settaiga'lukkuk keezhaagak ko'nduvanthu vaiththaarga'l. 
