verse	14	6	19	en theavanaagiya karththaavea, umathu adiyean umathu sannithiyil seygi'ra vi'n'nappaththaiyum man'raattaiyum keattu, umathu adiyeanudaiya vi'n'nappaththaiyum vea'nduthalaiyum thiruvu'laththil ko'ndaru'lum. 
