verse	14	8	9	israveal puththiraril oruvaraiyum saalomoan than vealaiyaich seyya adimaippaduththavillai; avarga'l yuththamanusharum, avanudaiya searvaikkaararin thalaivarum, avanudaiya irathangga'lukkum kuthiraiveerarukkum thalaivarumaayirunthaarga'l. 
verse	14	8	10	raajaavaagiya saalomoanudaiya oozhiyakkaararin thalaivaraagiya ivarga'lil irunoot'ru aimbathupear janaththai aa'ndaarga'l. 
verse	14	8	11	saalomoan: karththarudaiya petti vantha sthalangga'l parisuththamaayirukki'rathu; aathalaal, isravealin raajaavaagiya thaaveethin aramanaiyilea en manaivi vaasampa'n'nalaagaathu en'ru solli, paarvoanin kumaaraththiyaith thaaveethin nagaraththilirunthu thaan ava'lukkuk kattina maa'ligaikkuk kudivarappa'n'ninaan. 
verse	14	8	12	athumutha'rko'ndu saalomoan thaan ma'ndabaththi'rku munbaagak kattiyiruntha karththarudaiya balipeedaththinmeal, 
