verse	14	8	14	avan than thagappanaagiya thaaveethudaiya piramaa'naththinpadiyea, aasaariyarga'l thangga'l thangga'l oozhiyaththaich seyyum vaguppuga'laiyum, leaviyar ovvoru naa'lin katta'laippadiyea thuthiththuch seaviththu aasaariyarukku munbaagath thangga'l oozhiyaththaich seyyum mu'raiga'laiyum, vaasal kaappavarga'l ovvoru vaasalil kaavalkaakkum vaguppuga'laiyum ni'rkappa'n'ninaan; theavanudaiya manushanaagiya thaaveethu ippadik katta'laiyittirunthaan. 
verse	14	8	15	sagala kaariyaththaiyum pokkishangga'lin kaariyaththaiyum ku'riththu, raajaa aasaariyarukkum leaviyarukkum koduththa katta'laiyai vittu avarga'l vilagaathirunthaarga'l. 
verse	14	8	16	ippadiyea karththarudaiya aalayaththukku asthibaaram poadappatta naa'lmuthal athai mudikkumattum saalomoanin vealaiyellaam nadanthea'rik karththarudaiya aalayam kattiththeernthathu. 
verse	14	8	17	pinbu saalomoan eathoam theasaththuk kadal oaraththilirukkum esiyoankeabearukkum ealoaththukkum poanaan. 
