verse	14	9	1	seabaavin raajasthiree saalomoanin keerththiyaik kea'lvippattapoathu, vidukathaiga'linaalea saalomoanaich soathikki'ratha'rkaaga, miguntha parivaaraththoadum, kanthavarkkangga'laiyum, miguthiyaana ponnaiyum iraththinangga'laiyum sumakki'ra ottagangga'loadum erusaleamukku vanthaa'l; ava'l saalomoanidaththil vanthapoathu, than manathiliruntha ellaavat'raiyum ku'riththu avanidaththil sambaashiththaa'l. 
verse	14	9	2	appozhuthu saalomoan ava'l keattavaiga'laiyellaam viduviththaan; ava'lukku viduvikkaathapadikku on'raagilum saalomoanukku ma'raiporu'laayirukkavillai. 
verse	14	9	3	seabaavin raajasthiree saalomoanudaiya gnaanaththaiyum avan aramanaiyaiyum, 
