verse	14	10	11	ippoathum en thagappan baaramaana nugaththai ungga'lmeal vaiththaar, naan ungga'l nugaththai athiga baaramaakkuvean; en thagappan ungga'laich savukkuga'linaalea tha'ndiththaar, naan ungga'laith thea'lga'linaalea tha'ndippean en'ru sollum en'raarga'l. 
verse	14	10	12	moon'raam naa'l ennidaththil vaarungga'l en'ru raajaa solliyirunthapadiyea, yerobeyaamum sagala janangga'lum moon'raam naa'lilea regobeyaamidaththil vanthaarga'l. 
verse	14	10	13	raajaavaagiya regobeyaam muthiyoar aaloasanaiyaith tha'l'livittu, avarga'lukkuk kadinamaana uththaravu koduththaan. 
