verse	15	8	26	avarga'l kaiyilea naan a'runoot'ru aimbathu thaalanthu ve'l'liyaiyum, noo'ruthaalanthu ni'raiyaana ve'l'lip pa'nimuttuga'laiyum, noo'ruthaalanthu ponnaiyum, 
