verse	15	8	29	neengga'l athai erusaleamilirukki'ra theavanudaiya aalayaththin a'raiga'lil aasaariyar leaviyarudaiya pirabukka'lukkum, isravealudaiya vamsaththalaivarga'lukkum munbaaga ni'ruththu oppuvikkumattum vizhippaayirunthu, athaik kaaththukko'l'lungga'l en'rean. 
