verse	15	10	32	benyameen, mallook, semariyaa enbavarga'lum; 
verse	15	10	33	aasoomin puththiraril mathnaayi, maththaththaa, saabaath, elipeleath, eremaayi, manaasea, simeyi enbavarga'lum; 
verse	15	10	34	baaniyin puththiraril maathaayi, amraam, ooveal, 
verse	15	10	35	benaayaa, bethiyaa, kelloo, 
