verse	16	9	21	ippadi naa'rpathu varushamaaga vanaantharaththil avarga'lukku on'rum ku'raivupadaathapadikku, avarga'laip paraamariththu vantheer; avarga'l vasthirangga'l pazhamaiyaayppoagavumillai, avarga'l kaalga'l veenggavumillai. 
