verse	23	37	7	ithoa, avan oru seythiyaikkeattu, than theasaththukkuth thirumbuvatha'rkaana aaviyai naan avanukku'l anuppi, avanai avan theasaththilea pattayaththaal vizhappa'n'nuvean en'ru karththar uraikki'raar enbathai ungga'l aa'ndavanidaththil sollungga'l en'raan. 
