verse	26	3	3	manupuththiranea, naan unakkuk kodukki'ra inthach suru'lai nee un vayit'rilea udko'ndu, athinaal un kudalga'lai nirappuvaayaaga en'raar; appozhuthu naan athaip pusiththean; athu en vaaykkuth theanaippoal thiththippaayirunthathu. 
verse	26	3	4	pinbu avar ennai noakki: manupuththiranea, nee poay, israveal santhathiyaaridaththil searnthu, en vaarththaiga'laikko'ndu avarga'loadea peasu. 
verse	26	3	5	vi'langgaatha peachchum, kadinamaana baashaiyumu'l'la janaththa'ndaikkalla, israveal santhathiyaaridaththi'rkea nee anuppappadugi'raay. 
verse	26	3	6	vi'langgaatha peachchum, thaangga'l sollum vaarththaiga'lai nee a'riyaatha kadinamaana baashaiyumu'l'la aneagamaana janangga'lidaththi'rku nee anuppappadavillai; naan avarga'lidaththi'rku unnai anuppinaalum, avarga'l unakkuch sevikoduppaarga'loa? 
verse	26	3	7	israveal veettaaroavenil, unakkuch sevikodukkamaattaarga'l; enakkea sevikodukkamaattoam engi'raarga'lea; israveal vamsaththaar anaivarum kadinamaana net'riyum murattaattamu'l'la iruthayamum u'l'lavarga'l. 
verse	26	3	8	ithoa, un mugaththai avarga'l mugaththukku ethiraagavum, un net'riyai avarga'l net'rikku ethiraagavum kettiyaakkinean. 
verse	26	3	9	un net'riyai vachchirakkallaippoalaakkinean, kanmalaiyaippaarkkilum kettiyaakkinean; avarga'l kalagamu'l'la veettaaren'ru nee avarga'lukkup bayappadaamalum avarga'l mugangga'lukkuk kalanggaamalum iru en'raar. 
verse	26	3	10	pinnum avar ennai noakki: manupuththiranea, naan unnudanea sollum en vaarththaiga'laiyellaam nee un seviga'laalea keattu, un iruthayaththil eat'rukko'ndu, 
verse	26	3	11	nee poay, si'raippatta un janaththin puththiraridaththilea searnthu, avarga'l keattaalum kea'laavittaalum avarga'loadea peasi, karththaraagiya aa'ndavar inninnathai uraikki'raar en'ru avarga'loadea sol en'raar. 
verse	26	3	12	appozhuthu aavi, ennai uyara eduththukko'ndathu; karththarudaiya sthaanaththilirunthu vi'langgiya avarudaiya magimaikku sthoaththiram u'ndaavathaaga en'ru enakkup pinnaagak kooppitta mahaa saththaththin iraichchalaik keattean. 
verse	26	3	13	on'roadon'ru i'nainthirukki'ra jeevanga'ludaiya settaiga'lin iraichchalaiyum, atha'rkethirea oadiya sakkarangga'lin iraichchalaiyum, mahaa saththaththin iraichchalaiyum keattean. 
verse	26	3	14	aavi ennai uyara eduththukko'ndathu; naan en aaviyin ukkiraththinaalea manangkasanthupoanean; aanaalum karththarudaiya karam enmeal balamaaga irunthathu. 
verse	26	3	15	keabaar nathiya'ndaiyilea thelaabeebilea thaabarikki'ra si'raippattavarga'lidaththukku naan vanthu, avarga'l thaabarikki'ra sthalaththilea thaabariththu, eazhunaa'l avarga'l naduvilea piramiththavanaayth thangginean. 
verse	26	3	16	eazhunaa'l mudinthapinbu karththarudaiya vaarththai enakku u'ndaagi, avar: 
verse	26	3	17	manupuththiranea, unnai israveal vamsaththaarukkuk kaavalaa'lanaaga vaiththean; nee en vaayinaalea vaarththaiyaikkeattu, en naamaththinaalea avarga'lai echcharippaayaaga. 
verse	26	3	18	saagavea saavaay en'ru naan thunmaarkkanukkuch sollugaiyil, nee thunmaarkkanaith than thunmaarkkamaana vazhiyil iraathapadikku echcharikkumpadiyaagavum, avanai uyiroadea kaakkumpadiyaagavum, athai avanukkuch sollaamalum, nee avanai echcharikkaamalum irunthaal, anthath thunmaarkkan than thunmaarkkaththilea saavaan; avan iraththappazhiyaiyoa un kaiyilea keadpean. 
verse	26	3	19	nee thunmaarkkanai echchariththum, avan than thunmaarkkaththaiyum than aagaatha vazhiyaiyum vittuth thirumbaama'r poavaanaagil, avan than thunmaarkkaththilea saavaan; neeyoaven'raal un aaththumaavaith thappuvippaay. 
verse	26	3	20	appadiyea, neethimaan than neethiyai vittuth thirumbi, neethikeadu seyyumpoathum, naan avanmun ida'ralai vaikkumpoathum, avan saavaan; nee avanai echcharikkaathapadiyinaalea avan than paavaththilea saavaan; avan seytha neethiga'l ninaikkappaduvathillai; avanudaiya iraththappazhiyaiyoa un kaiyilea keadpean. 
verse	26	3	21	neethimaan paavagn seyyaathapadikku nee neethimaanai echchariththapinbu avan paavagnseyyaavittaal, avan pizhaikkavea pizhaippaan; avan echcharikkappattaan; neeyum un aaththumaavaith thappuviththaay en'raar. 
verse	26	3	22	avvidaththilea karththarudaiya karam enmeal amarnthathu; avar: nee ezhunthirunthu pa'l'laththaakkukkup pu'rappattuppoa, anggea unnudanea peasuvean en'raar. 
verse	26	3	23	appadiyea naan ezhunthirunthu, pa'l'laththaakkukkup pu'rappattup poanean; ithoa, keabaar nathiya'ndaiyilea naan ka'nda magimaikkuch sariyaaga anggea karththarudaiya magimai vi'langginathu; appozhuthu naan mugangkuppu'ra vizhunthean. 
verse	26	3	24	udanea aavi enakku'l'lea pugunthu, ennaik kaaloon'ri ni'rkumpadi seythathu, appozhuthu avar ennudanea peasi: nee poay, un veettukku'l'lea unnai adaiththukko'ndiru. 
verse	26	3	25	ithoa, manupuththiranea, unmeal kayi'ruga'laippoattu, avaiga'laal unnaik kattappoagi'raarga'l; aagaiyaal nee avarga'lukku'l'lea poagavea'ndaam. 
verse	26	3	26	naan un naavai un mealvaayoadea ottikko'l'lappa'n'nuvean; nee avarga'laik kadinthuko'l'lugi'ra manushanaayiraamal, oomaiyanaayiruppaay; avarga'l kalagaveettaar. 
verse	26	3	27	naan unnoadea peasumpoathu, un vaayaith thi'rappean; appozhuthu karththaraagiya aa'ndavar inninnathai uraiththaar en'ru avarga'loadea solvaay; keadki'ravan keadkattum, kea'laathavan kea'laathirukkattum; avarga'l kalagaveettaar. 
verse	26	4	1	manupuththiranea, nee oru senggalai eduththu, athai unmun vaiththu, athinmeal erusaleam nagaraththai varainthu, 
verse	26	4	2	atha'rku viroathamaaga mut'rikkaipoattu, atha'rku viroathamaagak koththa'langga'laik katti, atha'rku viroathamaaga ma'nmeadupoattu, atha'rku viroathamaaga iraa'nuvangga'lai ni'ruththi, sut'rilum atha'rku viroathamaaga mathilidikkum yanthirangga'lai vai. 
verse	26	4	3	mealum nee oru iruppuchsattiyai vaanggi, athai unakkum nagaraththukkum naduvaaga iruppuchsuvaraakki, athu mut'rikkaiyaayk kidakkumpadikku un mugaththai atha'rku nearaayth thiruppi, athai mut'rikkaipoattukko'ndiru; ithu israveal vamsaththukku adaiyaa'lam. 
verse	26	4	4	nee un idathupakkamaay orukka'liththup paduththu, athinmeal israveal vamsaththaarin akkiramaththaich sumaththikko'l; nee anthappakkamaay orukka'liththirukkum naadka'lin ilakkaththinpadiyea avarga'ludaiya akkiramaththaich sumappaay. 
verse	26	4	5	avarga'ludaiya akkiramaththin varushangga'lai unakku naadka'nakkaay e'n'nak katta'laiyittean; munnoot'ruth tho'n'noo'ru naadka'lvaraikkum nee israveal vamsaththaarin akkiramaththaich sumakkavea'ndum. 
verse	26	4	6	nee ivaiga'lai ni'raiveat'rinapinbu, ma'rupadiyum un valathupakkamaay orukka'liththu, yoothaa vamsaththaarin akkiramaththai naa'rpathunaa'lvaraikkum sumakkavea'ndum; ovvoru varushaththukkup bathilaaga ovvoru naa'lai unakkuk katta'laiyittean. 
verse	26	4	7	nee erusaleamin mut'rikkaikku nearaagath thiruppiya mugamum, thi'rantha puyamumaaga irunthu, atha'rku viroathamaagath theerkkatharisanam sollu. 
verse	26	4	8	ithoa, nee athai mut'rikkaippoadum naadka'lai ni'raiveat'rumattum oru pakkaththilirunthu ma'rupakkaththil pura'lakkoodaathapadikku unnaik kayi'ruga'laal kattuvean. 
verse	26	4	9	nee koathumaiyaiyum vaa'rkoathumaiyaiyum perumpayat'raiyum si'rupayat'raiyum thinaiyaiyum kambaiyum vaanggi, avaiga'lai oru paaththiraththilea poattu, avaiga'laal unakku appagnsuduvaay; nee orukka'liththup padukkum naadka'ludaiya ilakkaththinpadiyea munnoot'ruth tho'n'noo'runaa'l athil eduththuch saappiduvaayaaga. 
verse	26	4	10	nee saappidum poajanam, naa'l on'rukku irubathu seakkal ni'raiyaayirukkum; appadi naa'lukkunaa'l saappiduvaayaaga. 
verse	26	4	11	tha'n'neeraiyum a'lavaay hin ennum padiyil aa'riloru panggaik kudippaay; appadi naa'lukkunaa'l kudippaayaaga. 
verse	26	4	12	athai vaa'rkoathumai adaiyaippoal saappiduvaayaaga; athu manushanilirunthu kazhintha kashdaththin va'rattiga'laal avarga'l ka'nga'lukku munbaagach sudappaduvathaaga. 
verse	26	4	13	atha'rku oththapadiyea israveal puththirar, naan avarga'laith thuraththugi'ra pu'rajaathiga'lukku'l'lea thangga'l appaththaith theettu'l'lathaagach saappiduvaarga'l en'ru karththar sonnaar. 
verse	26	4	14	appozhuthu naan: aa, karththaraagiya aa'ndavarea, ithoa, en aaththumaa theettuppadavillai; thaanaaych seththathaiyaavathu, pee'ru'ndathaiyaavathu naan en si'ruvayathumuthal ithuvaraikkum saappittathillai; aruvaruppaana i'raichchi en vaaykkudpattathumillai en'rean. 
verse	26	4	15	appozhuthu avar ennai noakki: paar, manusha kashdaththin va'rattikkup bathilaaga unakku maattuchchaa'ni va'rattiyaik katta'laiyidugi'rean; athinaal un appaththaich suduvaayaaga en'raar. 
verse	26	4	16	pinnum avar: manupuththiranea, ithoa, appamum tha'n'neerum avarga'lukkuk ku'raiyavum, avanavan thidukkidavum, avarga'l thangga'l akkiramaththilea vaadippoagavum, 
verse	26	4	17	naan erusaleamilea appam ennum aatharavukoalai mu'rikki'rean; avarga'l appaththai ni'raiyinpadiyea visaaraththoadea saappittu, tha'n'neerai a'lavinpadiyea thidukkiduthaloadea kudippaarga'l. 
verse	26	5	1	pinnum avar: manupuththiranea, savaragan kaththiyaagiya karukkaana kaththiyai vaanggi, athinaal un thalaiyaiyum un thaadiyaiyum siraiththukko'ndu, pinbu ni'rukkum tharaasai eduththu, antha mayiraip panggidakkadavaay. 
verse	26	5	2	moon'ril oru panggai eduththu mut'rikkaipoadum naadka'l mudigi'rapoathu nagaraththin naduvilea akkiniyaal sutteriththu, moon'ril oru panggai eduththu, athaich sut'rilum kaththiyaalea vetti, moon'ril oru panggai eduththuk kaat'rilea thoot'rakkadavaay; avaiga'lin pinnaaga naan pattayaththai uruvuvean. 
verse	26	5	3	athil kognchammaaththiram eduththu, athai un vasthiraththoarangga'lil mudinthuvaippaayaaga. 
verse	26	5	4	pinnum athil kogncham eduththu, athaith theeyin naduvil e'rinthu, athai akkiniyaal sutterippaayaaga; athilirunthu israveal vamsaththaar anaivarukkum viroathamaaga akkini pu'rappadum. 
verse	26	5	5	karththaraagiya aa'ndavar sollugi'rathu ennaven'raal, ithuvea erusaleam, pu'rajaathiga'lin naduvilea naan athai vaiththean, athaich sut'rilum theasangga'l irukki'rathu. 
verse	26	5	6	athu pu'rajaathiga'laippaarkkilum en niyaayangga'laiyum, thannaich sut'rilum irukki'ra theasangga'laippaarkkilum en katta'laiga'laiyum akkiramamaaga maat'rippoattathu; avarga'l en niyaayangga'lai ve'ruththu, en katta'laiga'lil nadavaama'r poanaarga'l. 
verse	26	5	7	aagaiyaal karththaraagiya aa'ndavar sollugi'rathu ennaven'raal, ungga'laich sut'rilum irukki'ra pu'rajaathiga'laippaarkkilum athigarikki'ravarga'laagiya neengga'l en katta'laiga'lilea nadavaamalum, en niyaayangga'linpadi seyyaamalum, ungga'laich sut'rilum irukki'ra pu'rajaathiga'ludaiya neethiniyaayangga'linpadiyaavathu nadavaamalum poanapadiyinaalea, 
verse	26	5	8	ithoa, naan, naanea unakku viroathamaaga vanthu, pu'rajaathiga'ludaiya ka'nga'lukku munbaaga un naduvilea neethi seluththi, 
verse	26	5	9	naan munbu seyyaathathum inichseyyaathiruppathumaanavithamaay unakku un ellaa aruvaruppuga'linimiththamum seyvean. 
verse	26	5	10	aathalaal un naduvilea pithaakka'l pi'l'laiga'laith thinbaarga'l; pi'l'laiga'l pithaakka'laith thinbaarga'l; naan unnil neethiseluththi unnil meethiyaayiruppavarga'laiyellaam sagala thisaiga'lilum sitha'rippoagappa'n'nuvean en'ru karththaraagiya aa'ndavar sollugi'raar. 
verse	26	5	11	aathalaal, cheeyen'rigazhappadaththakkathum aruvarukkappadaththakkathumaana un kiriyaiga'laal nee en parisuththa sthalaththaith theettuppaduththinapadiyaal en ka'n unnaith thappavidaathu, naan unnaik ku'rugippoagappa'n'nuvean, naan iranggamaattean, ithai en jeevanaikko'ndu sollugi'rean en'ru karththaraagiya aa'ndavar uraikki'raar. 
verse	26	5	12	unnilea moon'ril oru panggu ko'l'lainoayaal saavaarga'l, pagnchaththaalum un naduvilea madinthupoavaarga'l; moon'ril oru panggu unnaich sut'rilum irukki'ra pattayaththaal vettu'ndu vizhuvaarga'l; moon'ril oru panggai naan sagala thisaiga'lilum sitha'rippoagappa'n'ni, avarga'l pinnea pattayaththai uruvuvean. 
verse	26	5	13	ippadi en koabam ni'raivea'rum; ippadi naan en ukkiraththai avarga'lmeal thanggappa'n'nugi'rathinaal ennai aat'rikko'lvean; naan en ukkiraththai avarga'lil ni'raiveat'rumpoathu, karththaraagiya naan en vairaakkiyaththilea ithaip peasinean en'ru a'rivaarga'l. 
verse	26	5	14	kadanthupoagi'ra yaavarudaiya ka'nga'lukku munbaagavum un sut'ruppu'raththaaraagiya jaathiga'lukku'l'lea naan unnaip paazhum ninthaiyumaakkuvean. 
verse	26	5	15	naan koabaththaalum ukkiraththaalum kodiya ka'ndanaiga'laalum, unnil neethiseluththumpoathu, un sut'ruppu'raththaaraagiya jaathiga'lukku athu ninthaiyum thurkkeerththiyum echcharippum piramippumaay irukkum; karththaraagiya naan ithaich sonnean. 
verse	26	5	16	ungga'lai azhippatha'rku naan anuppum azhivukkeathuvaana pagnchaththin kodiya ambuga'lai naan avarga'lukku'l'lea eyyumpoathu, naan pagnchaththai ungga'lmeal athigarikkappa'n'ni, ungga'l appam ennum aatharavukoalai mu'riththuppoaduvean. 
verse	26	5	17	pagnchaththaiyum, unnaip pi'l'laiyillaama'rpoagappa'n'num thushdamirugangga'laiyum ungga'lukku viroathamaaga anuppuvean; ko'l'lainoayum iraththagnsinthuthalum unnil sut'riththiriyum; pattayaththai naan unmeal varappa'n'nuvean; karththaraagiya naan ithaich sonnean en'raar. 
verse	26	6	1	karththarudaiya vaarththai enakku u'ndaagi, avar: 
verse	26	6	2	manupuththiranea, nee isravealin parvathangga'lukku nearaaga un mugaththaith thiruppi, avaiga'lukku viroathamaagath theerkkatharisanam uraiththuch sollavea'ndiyathu ennaven'raal, 
verse	26	6	3	isravealin parvathangga'lea, karththaraagiya aa'ndavarin vaarththaiyaik kea'lungga'l; karththaraagiya aa'ndavar parvathangga'laiyum kun'ruga'laiyum oadaiga'laiyum pa'l'laththaakkuga'laiyum noakki: ithoa, ungga'lmeal naan, naanea pattayaththai varappa'n'ni, ungga'l meadaiga'lai azhiththuppoaduvean. 
verse	26	6	4	ungga'l balipeedangga'l paazhaakkappattu, ungga'l silaiga'l thagarkkappadum; ungga'lil kolaiyu'ngi'ravarga'lai ungga'l naragalaana vikkiragangga'lukku munbaaga vizhappa'n'nuvean. 
verse	26	6	5	naan israveal puththirarudaiya pireathangga'lai avarga'ludaiya naragalaana vikkiragangga'lin munnea kidakkappa'n'ni, ungga'l balipeedangga'laich sut'rilum ungga'l elumbuga'laich sitha'rappa'n'nuvean. 
verse	26	6	6	ungga'l balipeedangga'l nirmoolamum paazhumaagumpadikkum, ungga'l naragalaana vikkiragangga'l thagarkkappattu, oaynthu, ungga'l silaiga'l vettu'ndu, ungga'l kiriyaiga'l kulainthupoagumpadikkum, ungga'ludaiya sagala vaasasthalangga'lilumu'l'la patta'nangga'l nirmoolamum ungga'l meadaiga'l paazhumaagum. 
verse	26	6	7	kolaiseyyappattavarga'l ungga'l naduvil vizhuvaarga'l; appozhuthu naan karththar en'ru a'rinthuko'lveerga'l. 
verse	26	6	8	neengga'l theasangga'lil sitha'radikkappadumpoathu, pu'rajaathiga'lukku'l'lea pattayaththukkuth thappuvaarai ungga'lukku meethiyaaga vaippean. 
verse	26	6	9	ennai vittuch soarampoagi'ra iruthayaththaikku'riththum, thangga'l naragalaana vikkiragangga'lin pinnea soarampoagi'ra thangga'l ka'nga'laikku'riththum manamadivaanean en'ru ungga'lil thappippoana avarga'l thaangga'l si'raippattirukkum pu'rajaathiga'lukku'l'lea ennai ninaiththu, thangga'ludaiya sagala aruvaruppuga'linaalum thaangga'l seytha pollaappuga'linimiththam thangga'laiyea ve'ruththu, 
verse	26	6	10	inthath theengguga'laiyellaam thangga'lukku nearidappa'n'nuvean en'ru karththaraagiya naan viruthaavaaych sonnathillaiyen'ru a'rinthuko'lvaarga'l en'raar. 
verse	26	6	11	karththaraagiya aa'ndavar sollugi'rathu ennaven'raal: nee un kaiyil adiththu, un kaalaal thatti, israveal vamsaththaarudaiya sagala pollaatha aruvaruppuga'linimiththamum aiyoa! en'ru sol; avarga'l pattayaththaalum pagnchaththaalum ko'l'lainoayaalum vizhuvaarga'l. 
verse	26	6	12	thooraththilirukki'ravan ko'l'lainoayaal saavaan; sameebaththilirukki'ravan pattayaththaal vizhuvaan; meethiyaayirunthu, mut'rikkaipoadappattavan pagnchaththaal saavaan; ippadi avarga'lil en ukkiraththaith theerththukko'l'luvean. 
verse	26	6	13	avarga'l thangga'l naragalaana sagala vikkiragangga'lukkum mathuravaasanaiyaana thoobaththaik kaattina sthalangga'laagiya uyarntha sagala meaduga'lilum, parvathangga'ludaiya sagala sigarangga'lilum, pachchaiyaana sagala virudchangga'linkeezhum, thazhaiththirukki'ra sagala karvaali marangga'linkeezhum, avarga'ludaiya naragalaana vikkiragangga'lin naduvilum avarga'ludaiya balipeedangga'laich sut'rilum, avarga'lil kolaiyu'ndavarga'l kidakkumpoathu, naan karththar en'ru a'rinthuko'lvaarga'l. 
verse	26	6	14	naan en kaiyai avarga'lukku viroathamaaga neetti, avarga'ludaiya ellaa vaasasthalangga'lumu'l'la theasaththai azhiththu, athaith thiblaaththin vanaantharaththaippaarkkilum athigamaayp paazhaakkuvean, appozhuthu naan karththar en'ru a'rinthuko'lvaarga'l en'raar. 
verse	26	7	1	pinnum karththarudaiya vaarththai enakku u'ndaagi, avar: 
