verse	26	14	4	aagaiyaal, nee avarga'loadea peasichsollavea'ndiyathu ennaven'raal: israveal vamsaththaaril thannudaiya naragalaana vikkiragangga'laith than iruthayaththinmeal naatti, than akkiramamaagiya ida'ralaith than mugaththukku ethiraaga vaiththukko'ndirukki'ra evanaagilum theerkkatharisiyinidaththil vanthaal, karththaraagiya naan israveal vamsaththaarudaiya iruthayaththil irukki'rathaip pidikkumpadiyaaga appadippattavanudaiya naragalaana vikkiragangga'lin thiradchikkuththakkathaaga uththaravu koduppean. 
verse	26	14	5	avarga'l ellaarum thangga'l naragalaana vikkiragangga'laip pinpat'ri, ennaivittup peathaliththuppoanaarga'l en'ru karththaraagiya aa'ndavar sollugi'raar. 
verse	26	14	6	aagaiyaal, nee israveal vamsaththaarai noakki: thirumbungga'l, ungga'l naragalaana vikkiragangga'lai vittuth thirumbungga'l; ungga'l sagala aruvaruppuga'laiyum vittu ungga'l mugangga'laith thiruppungga'l en'ru karththaraagiya aa'ndavar uraikki'raar. 
