verse	26	14	9	oru theerkkatharisi eththappattu oru viseashaththaich sonnaanaagil, appadikkoththa theerkkatharisiyaik karththaraagiya naanea eththappadappa'n'ninean; naan avanukku viroathamaaga en kaiyai neetti, avanai israveal janaththin naduvil iraathapadikku azhippean. 
