verse	26	14	11	israveal vamsaththaar ini ennaivittu vazhithappippoagaamalum, thangga'l ellaa mee'ruthalga'laalum ini asusippadaamalum irukkumporuttaaga ippadich sambavikkum; appozhuthu avarga'l en janamaayiruppaarga'l, naan avarga'l theavanaayiruppean en'ru karththaraagiya aa'ndavar uraikki'raar en'ru sol en'raar. 
verse	26	14	12	karththarudaiya vaarththai enakku u'ndaagi, avar: 
verse	26	14	13	manupuththiranea, oru theasam enakku viroathamaayth thuroagampa'n'nikko'ndeayirunthu, paavagnseythaal, naan atha'rku viroathamaaga en kaiyai neetti, athil appam ennum aatharavukoalai mu'riththu, athil pagnchaththai anuppi, manusharaiyum mirugangga'laiyum athil iraathapadikku naasampa'n'nuvean. 
