verse	26	14	15	naan theasaththil thushdamirugangga'lai anuppa, ammirugangga'linimiththam oruvarum athin vazhiyaay nadakkakkoodaathapadi ve'rumaiyum paazhumaagumpoathu, 
verse	26	14	16	antha moon'ru purusharum athin naduvil irunthaalum, thaangga'lmaaththiram thappuvaarga'leayallaamal, kumaararaiyaagilum kumaaraththiga'laiyaagilum thappuvikkamaattaarga'l; theasamum paazhaayppoagum en'ru en jeevanaikko'ndu sollugi'rean enbathaik karththaraagiya aa'ndavar uraikki'raar. 
