verse	26	14	18	antha moon'ru purusharum athin naduvil irunthaalum, thaangga'lmaaththiram thappuvaarga'leayallaamal, kumaararaiyaagilum kumaaraththiga'laiyaagilum thappuvikkamaattaarga'l en'ru en jeevanaikko'ndu sollugi'rean enbathaik karththaraagiya aa'ndavar uraikki'raar. 
verse	26	14	19	allathu naan anthath theasaththil ko'l'lainoayai anuppi, athilu'l'la manusharaiyum mirugangga'laiyum naasampa'n'numpadi athinmeal iraththappazhiyaaga en ukkiraththai oot'rumpoathu, 
verse	26	14	20	noavaavum thaaniyealum yoabum athin naduvil irunthaalum, avarga'l thangga'l neethiyinaal thangga'l aaththumaakka'lai maaththiram thappuvippaarga'leayallaamal, kumaaranaiyaagilum, kumaaraththiyaiyaagilum thappuvikkamaattaarga'l en'ru en jeevanaikko'ndu sollugi'rean enbathaik karththaraagiya aa'ndavar uraikki'raar. 
verse	26	14	21	aagaiyaal, karththaraagiya aa'ndavar sollugi'rathu ennaven'raal: naan manusharaiyum mirugangga'laiyum naasampa'n'numpadi erusaleamukku viroathamaagap pattayam, pagncham, thushdamirugangga'l, ko'l'lainoay ennum innaangu kodiya tha'ndanaiga'laiyum anuppumpoathu evva'lavu athiga sanggaaramaagum? 
verse	26	14	22	aagilum, ithoa, athilea thappi meethiyaagi ve'liyea ko'nduvarappadugi'ra kumaararum kumaaraththiga'lum silar iruppaarga'l; ithoa, avarga'l ungga'la'ndaikkup pu'rappattu varuvaarga'l; appozhuthu neengga'l avarga'l maarkkaththaiyum avarga'l kiriyaiga'laiyum ka'ndu, naan erusaleaminmeal varappa'n'nina theenggaiyum athinmeal naan varappa'n'nina ellaavat'raiyungku'riththuth theat'rappaduveerga'l. 
