verse	26	15	5	ithoa, athu veagaathirukkumpoathea oru vealaikkum uthavaathirukka, akkini athai eriththu, athu venthupoanapinbu, athu ini oru vealaikku uthavuvatheppadi? 
verse	26	15	6	aathalaal, karththaraagiya aa'ndavar sollugi'rathu ennaven'raal: kaattuch sediga'lukku'l'lirukki'ra thiraadchachsediyai naan akkinikku iraiyaaga oppukkoduththathupoala, erusaleamin kudiga'laiyum appadiyea oppukkoduththu, 
