verse	26	16	7	unnai vayalin payiraippoala aneagamaayiramaayp perugumpadi vaiththean; nee va'larnthu periyava'laagi, mahaa saunthariyavathiyaanaay; un sthanangga'l ezhumbina, un mayir va'larnthathu; aanaalum, nee nirvaa'namum amma'namumaayirunthaay. 
