verse	26	33	13	pizhaikkavea pizhaippaay en'ru naan neethimaanukkuch sollumpoathu, avan than neethiyai nambi, aniyaayagnseythaal, avanudaiya neethiyil on'rum ninaikkappaduvathillai, avan seytha than aniyaayaththilea saavaan. 
verse	26	33	14	pinnum saagavea saavaay en'ru naan thunmaarkkanukkuch sollumpoathu, avan than paavaththaivittuth thirumbi, niyaayamum neethiyugnseythu, 
