verse	26	44	3	ithu athibathikkea uriyathu, athibathi karththarudaiya sannithiyil poajanampa'n'numpadi ithil udkaaruvaan; avan vaasal ma'ndabaththin vazhiyaayp piraveasiththu, ma'rupadiyum athin vazhiyaayp pu'rappaduvaan en'raar. 
verse	26	44	4	pinbu avar ennai vadakku vaasalvazhiyaay aalayaththin mugappilea azhaiththukko'ndupoanaar; ithoa, karththarudaiya aalayam karththarudaiya magimaiyaal ni'rainthathai naan ka'ndu, mugangkuppu'ra vizhunthean. 
