verse	27	10	21	saththiya ezhuththilea ka'ndirukki'rathai naan unakkuth therivippean; ungga'l athibathiyaagiya migaavealaiththavira ennoadeakooda avarga'lukku viroathamaayp balangko'l'lugi'ra vea'roruvarum illai. 
