verse	27	11	5	then'risai raajaa balavaanaayiruppaan; aanaalum avanudaiya pirabukka'lil oruvan avanaippaarkkilum balavaanaagi aa'luvaan; ivanudaiya aa'lugai balaththa aa'lugaiyaayirukkum. 
