verse	38	2	13	maamsamaana sagalamaana pearga'lea, karththarukku munbaaga maunamaayirungga'l; avar thamathu parisuththa vaasasthalaththilirunthu ezhuntharu'linaar en'ru sol en'raar. 
verse	38	3	1	avar pirathaana aasaariyanaagiya yoasuvaavai enakkuk kaa'nbiththaar; avan karththarudaiya thoothanukku munbaaga nin'raan; saaththaan avanukku viroathagnseyya avan valathupakkaththilea nin'raan. 
verse	38	3	2	appozhuthu karththar saaththaanai noakki: karththar unnaik kadinthuko'lvaaraaga; saaththaanea, erusaleamaith therinthuko'nda karththar unnaik kadinthuko'lvaaraaga; ivan akkiniyinin'ru thappuvikkappatta ko'l'li allavaa en'raar. 
verse	38	3	3	yoasuvaavoavenil azhukku vasthiram thariththavanaayth thoothanukku munbaaga nin'rirunthaan. 
verse	38	3	4	avar thamakku munbaaga ni'rki'ravarga'lai noakki: ivanmeal irukki'ra azhukku vasthirangga'laik ka'lainthupoadungga'l en'raar; pinbu avanai noakki: paar, naan un akkiramaththai unnilirunthu neenggachseythu, unakkuch si'rantha vasthirangga'laith tharippiththean en'raar. 
verse	38	3	5	avan sirasinmeal suththamaana paagaiyai vaippaarga'laaga en'raar; appozhuthu suththamaana paagaiyai avan sirasinmeal vaiththu, avanukku vasthirangga'laith tharippiththaarga'l; karththarudaiya thoothan anggea nin'raar. 
verse	38	3	6	karththarudaiya thoothan yoasuvaavukkuch saadchiyaaga: 
verse	38	3	7	seanaiga'lin karththar uraikki'rathu ennaven'raal: nee en vazhiga'lil nadanthu en kaavalaik kaaththaal, nee en aalayaththil niyaayam visaarippaay; en piraagaarangga'laiyum kaavalkaappaay; inggea ni'rki'ravarga'lukku'l'lea ulaavugi'ratha'rku idam naan unakkuk katta'laiyiduvean. 
verse	38	3	8	ippoathum, pirathaana aasaariyanaagiya yoasuvaavea, nee kea'l; unakku munbaaga udkaarnthirukki'ra un thoazharum keadkakkadavarga'l; ivarga'l adaiyaa'lamaayirukki'ra purushar; ithoa, ki'lai ennappattavaraagiya en thaasanai naan varappa'n'nuvean. 
verse	38	3	9	ithoa, naan yoasuvaavukku munbaaga vaiththa kal; intha orea kallinmeal eazhu ka'nga'lum vaikkappattirukki'rathu; ithoa, naan athin siththiravealaiyai ni'raiveat'ri, inthath theasaththil akkiramaththai oreanaa'lilea neekkippoaduvean en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	3	10	annaa'lilea neengga'l oruvaraiyoruvar thiraadchachsediyinkeezhum aththimaraththinkeezhum varavazhaippeerga'l en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar en'raar. 
verse	38	4	1	ennoadea peasina thoothan thirumbivanthu niththiraipa'n'nugi'ra oruvanai ezhuppuvathupoal ennai ezhuppi: 
verse	38	4	2	nee kaa'ngi'rathu ennaven'ru keattaar; atha'rku naan: ithoa, muzhuvathum ponninaal seyyappatta kuththuvi'lakkaik kaa'ngi'rean; athin uchchiyil athin ki'n'namum, athinmeal athin eazhu agalga'lum, athin uchchiyil irukki'ra agalga'lukkuppoagi'ra eazhu kuzhaayga'lum irukki'rathu. 
verse	38	4	3	athin arugil ki'n'naththi'rku valathupu'ramaaga on'rum, atha'rku idathupu'ramaaga on'rum, aaga ira'ndu olivamarangga'l irukki'rathu en'rean. 
verse	38	4	4	naan ennoadea peasina thoothanai noakki: aa'ndavanea, ivaiga'l ennaven'ru keattean. 
verse	38	4	5	ennoadea peasina thoothan ma'rumozhiyaaga: ivaiga'l innathen'ru unakkuth theriyaathaa en'raar; aa'ndavanea, enakkuth theriyaathu en'rean. 
verse	38	4	6	appozhuthu avar: serubaabealukkuch sollappadugi'ra karththarudaiya vaarththai ennaven'raal, balaththinaalum alla, baraakkiramaththinaalum alla, ennudaiya aaviyinaaleayea aagum en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	4	7	periya parvathamea, nee emmaaththiram? serubaabealukku munbaaga nee samaboomiyaavaay; thalaikkallai avan ko'nduvaruvaan; atha'rkuk kirubaiyu'ndaavathaaga, kirubaiyu'ndaavathaaga en'ru aarpparippaarga'l en'raar. 
verse	38	4	8	pinnum karththarudaiya vaarththai enakku u'ndaagi, avar: 
verse	38	4	9	serubaabealin kaiga'l intha aalayaththukku asthibaaram poattathu; avan kaiga'lea ithai mudiththuth theerkkum; athinaal seanaiga'lin karththar ennai ungga'lidaththi'rku anuppinaaren'ru a'rivaay. 
verse	38	4	10	a'rpamaana aarambaththin naa'lai yaar asattaipa'n'nalaam? boomiyenggum sut'rippaarkki'ravaiga'laagiya karththarudaiya eazhu ka'nga'lum serubaabealin kaiyil irukki'ra thookkunoolaich santhoashamaayp paarkki'rathu en'raar. 
verse	38	4	11	pinbu naan avarai noakki: kuththuvi'lakkukku valathupu'ramaagavum atha'rku idathupu'ramaagavum irukki'ra intha ira'ndu olivamarangga'l ennaven'ru keattean. 
verse	38	4	12	ma'rupadiyum naan avarai noakki: ira'ndu po'rkuzhaayga'lin vazhiyaayth thonggi, ponni'ramaana e'n'neyaith thangga'lilirunthu i'ranggappa'n'nugi'ravaiga'laagiya olivamarangga'lin ira'ndu ki'laiga'l ennaven'ru keattean. 
verse	38	4	13	atha'rku avar: ivaiga'l innathen'ru unakkuth theriyaathaa en'raar; aa'ndavanea, enakkuth theriyaathu en'rean. 
verse	38	4	14	appozhuthu avar: ivaiga'l ira'ndum sarvaloagaththukkum aa'ndavaraayirukki'ravarin samugaththil ni'rki'ra abisheagam pet'ravarga'l en'raar. 
verse	38	5	1	naan thirumbavum en ka'nga'lai ea'reduththup paarkkaiyil, ithoa, pa'rakki'ra oru pusthagachsuru'laik ka'ndean. 
verse	38	5	2	thoothan: nee kaa'ngi'rathu ennaven'ru keattaar; pa'rakki'ra oru pusthagachsuru'laik kaa'ngi'rean, athin nee'lam irubathu muzhamum athin agalam paththu muzhamumaayirukki'rathu en'rean. 
verse	38	5	3	appozhuthu avar: ithu boomiyinmeethenggum pu'rappattuppoagi'ra saabam; enthath thirudanum athin oru pu'raththilirukki'rathinpadiyea azhikkappattuppoavaan; aa'naiyidugi'ra evanum, athin ma'rupu'raththil irukki'rathinpadiyea azhikkappattuppoavaan. 
verse	38	5	4	athu thirudan veettilum, en naamaththaikko'ndu poyyaa'naiyidugi'ravan veettilum vanthu, avanavan veettin naduvilea thanggi, athai athin marangga'loadum athin kalluga'loadungkooda nirmoolamaakkumpadi athaip pu'rappattuppoagappa'n'nuvean en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar en'raar. 
verse	38	5	5	pinbu ennoadea peasina thoothan ve'liyea vanthu ennai noakki: nee un ka'nga'lai ea'reduththu, pu'rappattuvarugi'rathai ennaven'ru paar en'raar. 
verse	38	5	6	athu ennaven'ru keattean; atha'rku avar: athu pu'rappattuvarugi'rathaagiya oru marakkaal en'raar. pinnum avar: boomiyenggum ithuthaan avarga'ludaiya ka'n'noakkam en'raar. 
verse	38	5	7	ithoa, oru thaalanthu ni'raiyaana eeyamoodi thookkivarappattathu; marakkaalin naduvilea oru sthiree udkaarnthirunthaa'l. 
verse	38	5	8	appozhuthu avar: iva'l akkiramakkaari en'ru solli, ava'lai marakkaalukku'l'lea tha'l'li eeyakkattiyai athin vaayilea poattaar. 
verse	38	5	9	appozhuthu naan en ka'nga'lai ea'reduththu, ithoa, pu'rappattuvarugi'ra ira'ndu sthireega'laik ka'ndean; avarga'lukku naaraiyin settaiga'lukkoththa settaiga'l irunthathu; avarga'l settaiga'lil kaat'rirunthathu; ivarga'l marakkaalaip boomikkum vaanaththukkum naduvaayth thookkikko'ndu poanaarga'l. 
verse	38	5	10	naan ennoadea peasina thoothanai noakki: ivarga'l marakkaalai enggea ko'ndupoagi'raarga'l en'ru keattean. 
verse	38	5	11	atha'rku avar: sineyaar theasaththilea atha'rku oru veettaik kattumpadikku athaik ko'ndupoagi'raarga'l; anggea athu sthaabikkappattu, than nilaiyilea vaikkappadum en'raar. 
verse	38	6	1	naan thirumbavum en ka'nga'lai ea'reduththu, ithoa, ira'ndu parvathangga'lin naduvaagap pu'rappattuvarugi'ra naalu irathangga'laik ka'ndean; anthap parvathangga'l ve'ngalap parvathangga'laayirunthana. 
verse	38	6	2	muthalaam irathaththil sivappuk kuthiraiga'lum, ira'ndaam irathaththil ka'ruppuk kuthiraiga'lum, 
verse	38	6	3	moon'raam irathaththil ve'l'laik kuthiraiga'lum, naangaam irathaththil pu'l'lipu'l'liyaana sivappuk kuthiraiga'lum poottiyirunthana. 
verse	38	6	4	naan ennoadea peasina thoothanai noakki: aa'ndavanea, ivaiga'l ennaven'ru keattean. 
verse	38	6	5	anthath thoothan enakkup pirathiyuththaramaaga: ivaiga'l sarvaloagaththukkum aa'ndavaraayirukki'ravarudaiya samugaththil nin'ru pu'rappadugi'ra vaanaththinudaiya naalu aaviga'l en'raar. 
verse	38	6	6	on'ril poottappattiruntha ka'ruppukkuthiraiga'l vadatheasaththukkup pu'rappattuppoayina; ve'nmaiyaana kuthiraiga'l avaiga'lin pinnaalea pu'rappattuppoayina; pu'l'lipu'l'liyaana kuthiraiga'l thentheasaththukkup pu'rappattuppoayina. 
verse	38	6	7	sivappuk kuthiraiga'loaven'raal pu'rappattuppoay, boomiyilea sut'riththiriyumpadi keattukko'ndana; atha'rku avar: poayp boomiyil sut'riththiriyungga'l en'raar; appadiyea boomiyilea sut'riththirinthana. 
verse	38	6	8	pinbu avar ennaik kooppittu: paar, vadatheasaththukkup pu'rappattuppoanavaiga'l, vadatheasaththilea en koabaththaich saanthipa'n'nit'ru en'ru ennoadea sonnaar. 
verse	38	6	9	pinbu karththarudaiya vaarththai enakku u'ndaagi, avar: 
verse	38	6	10	si'raiyiruppin manusharaagiya elthaayum, thobiyaavum, yethaayaavum baabiloanilirunthu vanthirukkum annaa'lilea nee poay, seppaniyaavin kumaaranaagiya yoasiyaavin veettukku'l piraveasiththu, 
verse	38	6	11	anggea avarga'l kaiyilea ve'l'liyaiyum ponnaiyum vaanggi, kireedangga'laich seyviththu, yoathsathaakkin kumaaranaagiya yoasuvaa ennum pirathaana aasaariyanudaiya sirasilea vaiththu, 
verse	38	6	12	avanoadea sollavea'ndiyathu: seanaiga'lin karththar uraikki'rathu ennaven'raal, ithoa, oru purushan, avarudaiya naamam ki'lai ennappadum; avar thammudaiya sthaanaththilirunthu mu'laiththezhumbik karththarudaiya aalayaththaik kattuvaar. 
verse	38	6	13	avarea karththarudaiya aalayaththaik kattuvaar; avar magimaiporunthinavaraay, thammudaiya singgaasanaththinmeal veet'rirunthu aa'lugai seyvaar; thammudaiya singgaasanaththinmeal aasaariyaraayum iruppaar; ivvira'ndin naduvaagach samaathaanaththin aaloasanai vi'langgum. 
verse	38	6	14	inthak kireedangga'loaven'raal, karththarudaiya aalayaththilea, ealeamukkum, thobiyaavukkum, yethaayaavukkum, seppaniyaavin kumaaranaagiya eanukkum ninaippoottuthalukken'ru vaikkappaduvathaaga. 
verse	38	6	15	thooraththilu'l'lavarga'l vanthu karththarudaiya aalayaththaik kooda irunthu kattuvaarga'l; appozhuthu seanaiga'lin karththar ennai ungga'lidaththi'rku anuppinaaren'ru a'rinthuko'lveerga'l; neengga'l ungga'l theavanaagiya karththarin saththaththaik keattu nadantheerga'laanaal ithu ni'raivea'rum en'ru sol en'raar. 
verse	38	7	1	thariyu raajaa arasaa'nda naalaam varusham, kislea ennum onbathaam maatham, naalaantheathiyilea, sagariyaavukkuk karththarudaiya vaarththai u'ndaayit'ru. 
verse	38	7	2	karththarudaiya samugaththil vi'n'nappampa'n'navum, 
verse	38	7	3	naangga'l iththanai varushamvaraiyilea seythathupoala ainthaam maathaththilea azhuthu odukkaththilirukkavea'ndumoa en'ru seanaiga'ludaiya karththarin aalayaththilirukkum aasaariyaridaththilum theerkkatharisiga'lidaththilum keadkavum, sareathsearum regemmeleakum avanudaiya manusharum theavanudaiya aalayaththukku anuppappattaarga'l. 
verse	38	7	4	appozhuthu seanaiga'ludaiya karththarin vaarththai enakku u'ndaagi, avar: 
verse	38	7	5	nee theasaththin ellaa janaththoadum aasaariyarga'loadum sollavea'ndiyathu ennaven'raal, neengga'l intha ezhubathu varushamaaga ainthaam maathaththilum eazhaam maathaththilum ubavaasampa'n'ni thukkangko'ndaadinapoathu neengga'l enakken'ruthaanaa ubavaasampa'n'nineerga'l? 
verse	38	7	6	neengga'l pusikki'rapoathum kudikki'rapoathum ungga'lukken'rallavaa pusikki'reerga'l? ungga'lukken'rallavaa kudikki'reerga'l? 
verse	38	7	7	erusaleamum athaich sut'rilum iruntha patta'nangga'lum kudini'rainthu sugamaayiruntha kaalaththilum the'rku naadum samaboomiyum kudiyea'riyiruntha kaalaththilum munniruntha theerkkatharisiga'laikko'ndu karththar koo'rina vaarththaiga'l ivaiga'l allavoa en'ru sol en'raar. 
verse	38	7	8	pinbu karththarudaiya vaarththai sagariyaavukku u'ndaagi, avar: 
verse	38	7	9	seanaiga'lin karththar uraikki'rathu ennaven'raal, neengga'l u'nmaiyaay niyaayantheerththu, avanavan thanthan sagoatharanukkuth thayavum irakkamum seythu, 
verse	38	7	10	vithavaiyaiyum thikkat'ra pi'l'laiyaiyum paratheasiyaiyum si'rumaiyaanavanaiyum odukkaamalum, ungga'lil oruvanum than sagoatharanukku viroathamaayth than iruthayaththil theenggu ninaiyaamalum irungga'l en'raar. 
verse	38	7	11	avarga'loa kavanikka manathillaamal, thangga'l thoa'lai murattuththanamaay vilakki, kea'laathapadikkuth thangga'l seviga'lai adaiththukko'ndaarga'l. 
verse	38	7	12	veathaththaiyum seanaiga'lin karththar thammudaiya aaviyin moolamaay munthina theerkkatharisiga'laikko'ndu solliyanuppina vaarththaiga'laiyum kea'laathapadikkuth thangga'l iruthayaththai vairamaakkinaarga'l; aagaiyaal mahaa kadungkoabam seanaiga'lin karththaridaththilirunthu u'ndaayit'ru. 
verse	38	7	13	aathalaal naan kooppittapoathu, avarga'l eppadik kea'laama'rpoanaarga'loa, appadiyea avarga'l kooppittapoathu naanum kea'laamalirunthean en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	7	14	avarga'l a'riyaatha pu'rajaathiga'lukku'l'lea avarga'laip pa'rakkadiththean; athinaal avarga'l pinvaiththuppoana theasam poakkuvaraththillaamal paazhaayppoayit'ru; avarga'l inbamaana theasaththaip paazhaayppoagap pa'n'ninaarga'l en'raar. 
verse	38	8	1	seanaiga'ludaiya karththarin vaarththai u'ndaagi, avar: 
verse	38	8	2	naan seeyoanukkaaga kadum vairaakkiyangko'ndean; atha'rkaaga mahaa ukkiramaana vairaakkiyangko'ndean en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	8	3	naan seeyoanidaththil thirumbi, erusaleamin naduvilea vaasampa'n'nuvean; erusaleam saththiya nagaram en'rum, seanaiga'ludaiya karththarin parvatham parisuththa parvatham en'rum azhaikkappadum en'ru karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	8	4	thirumbavum erusaleamin veethiga'lil muthirvayathinaalea thangga'l kaiga'lil koalaippidiththu nadakki'ra kizhavarum kizhaviga'lum kudiyiruppaarga'l. 
verse	38	8	5	nagaraththin therukka'lilea vi'laiyaadugi'ra aa'npi'l'laiga'lum pe'npi'l'laiga'lum athin veethiga'lil ni'rainthirukkum en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	8	6	seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'rathu ennaven'raal: athu intha janaththil meethiyaanavarga'lin paarvaikku innaadka'lil aachchariyamaayirunthaalum, en paarvaikkum aachchariyamaayirukkumoa en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	8	7	ithoa, kizhakkutheasaththilum mea'rku theasaththilumirunthu en janangga'lai naan iradchiththu, 
verse	38	8	8	avarga'lai azhaiththukko'nduvaruvean; avarga'l erusaleamin naduvilea kudiyiruppaarga'l; avarga'l enakku u'nmaiyum neethiyumaana janamaayiruppaarga'l, naan avarga'lukkuth theavanaayiruppean en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	8	9	seanaiga'ludaiya karththarin veedaagiya aalayam kattappadumpadikku athin asthibaarangga'l poadappatta naa'lmutha'r ko'ndirukki'ra theerkkatharisiga'lin vaayinaal intha vaarththaiga'lai innaadka'lil keattuvarugi'ravarga'lea, ungga'l kaiga'l thidappadakkadavathu en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	8	10	innaadka'lukku munnea manushanudaiya vealaiyaal palanumillai, mirugajeevanudaiya vealaiyaal palanumillai; poagi'ravanukkum varugi'ravanukkum nerukkidaiyinimiththam samaathaanamumillai; ellaa manusharaiyum oruvaraiyoruvar viroathikkachseythean. 
verse	38	8	11	ippoathoa intha janaththil meethiyaanavarga'lukku naan munthinanaadka'lil irunthathupoala irukkamaattean en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	8	12	vithaippuch samaathaanamu'l'lathaayirukkum; thiraadchachsedi than kaniyaith tharum; boomi than palanaith tharum; vaanam than paniyaith tharum; intha janaththil meethiyaanavarga'l ithaiyellaam suthantharikkak katta'laiyiduvean. 
verse	38	8	13	sambavippathennaven'raal: yoothaa vamsaththaarea, israveal vamsaththaarea, neengga'l pu'rajaathiga'lukku'l'lea saabamaayirunthathupoalavea, aaseervaathamaayirukkumpadi naan ungga'lai iradchippean; bayappadaatheayungga'l, ungga'l kaiga'l thidappadakkadavathu. 
verse	38	8	14	seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'rathu ennaven'raal: ungga'l pithaakka'l enakkuk koabamoottinapoathu naan ungga'laith tha'ndikka ninaiththu, manam maa'raamal irunthathupoala, 
verse	38	8	15	innaadka'lil erusaleamukkum yoothaavukkum nanmaiseyyumpadith thirumba ninaiththean; bayappadaatheayungga'l. 
verse	38	8	16	neengga'l seyyavea'ndiya kaariyangga'l ennaven'raal: avanavan pi'ranoadea u'nmaiyaip peasungga'l; ungga'l vaasalga'lil saththiyaththukkum samaathaanaththukkum ea'rka niyaayantheerungga'l. 
verse	38	8	17	oruvanum pi'ranukku viroathamaayth than iruthayaththil theenggu ninaiyaamalum, poyyaa'naiyinmeal piriyappadaamalum irungga'l; ivaiga'lellaam naan ve'rukki'ra kaariyangga'l en'ru karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	8	18	seanaiga'ludaiya karththarin vaarththai enakku u'ndaagi, avar: 
verse	38	8	19	naalaam maathaththin ubavaasamum, ainthaam maathaththin ubavaasamum, eazhaam maathaththin ubavaasamum, paththaam maathaththin ubavaasamum, yoothaa vamsaththaarukku magizhchchiyaagavum santhoashamaagavum nalla pa'ndigaiga'laagavum maa'rippoagum; aagaiyaal saththiyaththaiyum samaathaanaththaiyum sineagiyungga'l en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
verse	38	8	20	innum janangga'lum aneagam patta'nangga'lin kudiga'lum varuvaarga'l en'ru seanaiga'lin karththar sollugi'raar. 
