verse	40	2	16	appozhuthu earoathu thaan saasthiriga'laal vagnchikkappattathaik ka'ndu, miguntha koabamadainthu, aadka'lai anuppi, thaan saasthiriga'lidaththil thittamaay visaariththa kaalaththinpadiyea, bethleheamilum athin sagala ellaiga'lilumiruntha ira'ndu vayathukkudpatta ellaa aa'npi'l'laiga'laiyum kolaiseythaan. 
