verse	42	2	48	thaay thagappanmaarum avaraik ka'ndu aachchariyappattaarga'l. appozhuthu avarudaiya thaayaar avarai noakki: maganea! ean engga'lukku ippadich seythaay? ithoa, un thagappanum naanum visaaraththoadea unnaith theadinoamea en'raa'l. 
verse	42	2	49	atha'rku avar: neengga'l ean ennaith theadineerga'l? en pithaavukkaduththavaiga'lil naan irukkavea'ndiyathen'ru a'riyeerga'laa en'raar. 
verse	42	2	50	thangga'lukku avar sonna vaarththaiyai avarga'l u'narnthuko'l'lavillai. 
