verse	42	3	29	yoasea eliyeasarin kumaaran; eliyeasar yoareemin kumaaran; yoareem maaththaaththin kumaaran; maaththaath leaviyin kumaaran. 
verse	42	3	30	leavi simiyoanin kumaaran; simiyoan yoothaavin kumaaran; yoothaa yoaseappin kumaaran; yoaseappu yoanaanin kumaaran; yoanaan eliyaakkeemin kumaaran. 
