verse	42	3	37	laameakku meththoosalaavin kumaaran; meththoosalaa eanoakkin kumaaran; eanoakku yaareathin kumaaran; yaareath magalaaleyealin kumaaran; magalaaleyeal keanaanin kumaaran; keanaan eanoasin kumaaran. 
verse	42	3	38	eanoas seaththin kumaaran; seath aathaamin kumaaran; aathaam theavanaal u'ndaanavan. 
