verse	42	4	9	appozhuthu avan avarai erusaleamukkuk ko'ndupoay, theavaalayaththu upparigaiyinmeal avarai ni'ruththi: neer theavanudaiya kumaaraneayaanaal, inggeayirunthu thaazhakkuthiyum. 
verse	42	4	10	eanenil, ummaik kaakkumpadikkuth thammudaiya thootharga'lukku ummaikku'riththuk katta'laiyiduvaar en'rum, 
