verse	42	4	26	aayinum eliyaa seethoan naattilu'l'la sarepthaa (saa'ripaath) ooriliruntha oru vithavaiyinidaththi'rku anuppappattaaneayallaamal mat'roruththiyinidaththi'rkum anuppappadavillai. 
verse	42	4	27	allaamalum elisaa theerkkatharisiyin kaalaththilea isravealarukku'l'lea aneagam kushdaroagiga'l irunthaarga'l; aayinum seeriyaa theasaththaanaagiya naagamaaneayallaamal avarga'lil vea'roruvanum suththamaakkappadavillai en'ru saththiyaththinpadiyea ungga'lukkuch sollugi'rean en'raar. 
verse	42	4	28	jebaaalayaththiliruntha ellaarum, ivaiga'laik keattapozhuthu, koabamoo'ndu, 
