verse	43	18	11	appozhuthu iyeasu peathuruvai noakki: un pattayaththai u'raiyilea poadu; pithaa enakkuk koduththa paaththiraththil naan baanampa'n'naathiruppeanoa en'raar. 
verse	43	18	12	appozhuthu poarchseavagarum, aayiram poarchseavagarukkuth thalaivanum, yootharudaiya oozhiyakkaararum iyeasuvaippidiththu, avaraik katti, 
