verse	43	18	21	neer ennidaththil visaarikkavea'ndiyathenna? naan sonnavaiga'laik keattavarga'lidaththil visaariyum; naan peasinavaiga'lai avarga'l a'rinthirukki'raarga'lea en'raar. 
