verse	43	18	36	iyeasu pirathiyuththaramaaga: en raajyam ivvulagaththi'rkuriyathalla, en raajyam ivvulagaththi'rkuriyathaanaal naan yootharidaththil oppukkodukkappadaathapadikku en oozhiyakkaarar poaraadiyiruppaarga'lea; ippadiyirukka en raajyam ivvidaththi'rkuriyathalla en'raar. 
verse	43	18	37	appozhuthu pilaaththu avarai noakki: appadiyaanaal nee raajaavoa en'raan. iyeasu pirathiyuththaramaaga: neer sollugi'rapadi naan raajaathaan; saththiyaththaikku'riththuch saadchikodukka naan pi'ranthean, itha'rkaagavea intha ulagaththil vanthean; saththiyavaan evanum en saththam keadki'raan en'raar. 
verse	43	18	38	atha'rkup pilaaththu: saththiyamaavathu enna en'raan. ma'rupadiyum avan yootharga'lidaththil ve'liyea vanthu: naan avanidaththil oru kut'ramum kaa'nean. 
