verse	43	18	40	appozhuthu: avarga'lellaarum ivanaiyalla, barabaasai viduthalaipa'n'navea'ndum en'ru ma'rupadiyum saththamittaarga'l; anthap barabaasenbavan ka'l'lanaayirunthaan. 
