verse	46	7	11	pirinthupoanaal ava'l vivaagamillaathirukkakkadava'l, allathu purushanoadea oppuravaagakkadava'l; purushanum than manaiviyaith tha'l'lividakkoodaathu. 
verse	46	7	12	mat'ravarga'laikku'riththuk karththar alla, naanea sollugi'rathaavathu: sagoatharanoruvanudaiya manaivi avisuvaasiyaayirunthum, avanudanea vaasamaayirukka ava'lukkuch sammathamirunthaal, avan ava'laith tha'l'lividaathirukkakkadavan. 
