verse	46	7	26	athennavenil, ippozhuthu u'ndaayirukki'ra thunbaththinimiththam vivaagamillaamalirukki'rathu manushanukku nalamaayirukkumen'ru e'n'nugi'rean. 
verse	46	7	27	nee manaiviyoadea kattappattirunthaal, avizhkkappada vagaitheadaathea; nee manaivi illaathavanaayirunthaal, manaiviyaith theadaathea. 
