verse	46	7	30	azhugi'ravarga'l azhaathavarga'lpoalavum, santhoashappadugi'ravarga'l santhoashappadaathavarga'lpoalavum, ko'l'lugi'ravarga'l ko'l'laathavarga'lpoalavum, 
