verse	46	7	36	aagilum oruvan than puththiriyin kannigaipparuvam kadanthupoanathinaalea, ava'l vivaagampa'n'naamaliruppathu ava'lukkuth thaguthiyallaven'rum, ava'l vivaagampa'n'nuvathu avasiyamen'rum ninaiththaal, avan than manathinpadi seyyakkadavan; athu paavamalla, vivaagampa'n'nattum. 
