verse	46	8	1	vikkiragangga'lukkup padaikkappattavaiga'laikku'riththa vishayaththil, nammellaarukkum a'rivu u'nden'ru namakkuth theriyumea. a'rivu i'rumaappai u'ndaakkum, anboa bakthiviruththiyai u'ndaakkum. 
verse	46	8	2	oruvan thaan eatheanum on'rai a'rinthavanen'ru e'n'nikko'lvaanaanaal, on'raiyum a'riyavea'ndiyapiragaaramaaga avan innum a'riyavillai. 
